<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Ndamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MATEYI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chilongu ngimu wuchiyandikiwili na Mateyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHILONGU CHA NYANYI CHIYANDIKIWILI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATEYI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULELU</para>
  <para style="ip">Chilongu cha Nyanyi ngimu wayandikili Mateyi ndi chitabu chimu gati ya fitabu mchechi mulilaghanu lya Shonu cheni chikusasambula ngalilu ya Yesu Kilistu. Kila chitabu chimu chikukemiwa Injili mana yaki “Chilongu cha Nyanyi”. Fitabu Mateyi na Maliku na Lukasi na Yohani fiyandikiwa pawonikili Yesu. Yivapwembukili vamanya ha chipindi liki chayandikiwili chitabu achi, lakini pamongapa yaveli kucha milongu sita kukandila pawonikili Yesu. Wuwula wula pala pavayandikilili pamanyikili ha, lakini vatangalili vakashili kucha chiyandikiwa Palesitina na pamongapa yaveli kucha mumbwani ya Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yayandikili aveli Mateyi, mweni aveli msumula mbiya chipindi Yesu aveli akali hela kumluva ghavi ndumindumi waki. Mweni kandi amanyikili kwa litawa lya Levi. Mateyi ndi yumu wa vandundami lilongu na vavili na mweni ayandikili ili Vayawudi vayisomi. Ayi yikuwesha kuwoneka lipala hela kwa nendu ya ngumbungumbu milongu sita mumayandiku va mulilaghanu lya shonu. Mweni ayilatili kulangusha kucha Yesu aveli Mkombola, Mkombola yashawuliwili na Chapanga, mweni vamutungili kucha dawoneki. Mateyi kandi ayandikili nendu kwilata wutwa wa Chapanga. Vayawudi vamanyili mkombola kuva mutwa wa mumlima. Mateyi alangushili kwa kuhimulila kwa chiganu ndambu wuyiveli kafwawuti gati ya wutwa wa pamlima na wula wutwa mng'alili wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chilongu cha nyanyi ngimu wayandikili Mateyi ndi chitabu chinofu cha kukandila lilaghanu lya Shonu kwanongwa ya ngumbungumbu shaki shosi sha lilaghanu lya Dahili. Chikuhasha malaghanu mavili. Kandi yivapwembukili vadeta kucha Mateyi akayeshili kuyesha kugola ngimu wufivelili fitabu fya Musa, fyeni ndi fitabu fya kwaa muhanu fya lilaghanu lya dahili. Kulandula kwa Yesu pachidunda (Mateyi sula ya 5-7) yikuwesha kulinganila na Chapanga akumgayila Malawu Musa (Ngumbungumbu sula ya 19:3-23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Fivelili mugati kwa chikata.</para>
  <para style="io">Mateyi akukanda Chilongu cha Nyanyi kwa kuwomba kwilata kuwoneka kwa Yesu Kilistu na kukanda kwa ngimbaniku yaki musula ya 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli Mateyi akuhimulila ngimbaniku ya Yesu na ng'ulilu shaki musula sha 5-25.3.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya mbelu Mateyi yiilata gati ya ngimbaniku ya Yesu munjifwa na kushukuka sula ya (26-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lukolu lwa Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 3:23-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu Kilistu afumili mulukolu lwa Dawudi na Dawudi afumili mulukolu lwa Ibulahimu. Alu ndi lulalanda lwa lukolu lwaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ibulahimu kamulela Isaka na</para>
  <para style="q">Isaka kamulela Yakobi</para>
  <para style="q">na Yakobi kamulela Yuda na vakulumundu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yuda amlelili Pelesi na Zela,</para>
  <para style="q">mawau aveli Tamali. Pelesi kamulela Hesilomi,</para>
  <para style="q">na Hesilomi kamulela Lami na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lami kamulela Aminadabu</para>
  <para style="q">na Aminadabu kamulela Nashoni</para>
  <para style="q">na Nashoni kamulela Salumoni na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Salumoni kamulela Boasi, mamundu Boasi aveli Lahabu.</para>
  <para style="q">Boasi na Lutu vaveli valeli va Obedi.</para>
  <para style="q">Na Obedi kamulela Yesi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesi kamulela Mutwa Dawudi.</para>
  <para style="q">Na Dawudi kamulela Solumoni, mawaki Solumoni mwanja mtasi aveli mdala wa Uliya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Solumoni kamulela Lehoboamu</para>
  <para style="q">na Lehoboamu kamulela Abiya</para>
  <para style="q">na Abiya kamulela Asa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>na Asa kamulela Yehoshafati</para>
  <para style="q">na Yehoshafati kamulela Yolamu</para>
  <para style="q">na Yolamu kamulela Usia.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na Usia kamulela Yofamu,</para>
  <para style="q">na Yofamu amlelili Ahasi,</para>
  <para style="q">na Ahasi kamulela Hezekia.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na Hezekia kamulela Manasi,</para>
  <para style="q">na Manasi kamulela Amosi,</para>
  <para style="q">na Amosi kamulela Yosia.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na Yosia kamulela Yekomia na vahaja vaki fyosi afi fyaveli chipindi Vayawudi pavatoliwili vavanda kuyenda Babiloni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vayawudi pavatoliwili kala kuuvanda kuluhamila aku Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q">Yekonia kamulela Shealitieli,</para>
  <para style="q">Shealitieli kamulela Zelubabeli.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na Zelubabeli kamulela Abyudi,</para>
  <para style="q">na Abyudi kamulela Eliyakimu,</para>
  <para style="q">na Eliyakimu kamulela Azoli.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Azoli kamulela Sadoki</para>
  <para style="q">na Sadoki kamulela Akimu</para>
  <para style="q">na Akimu kamulela Eliyudi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Eliyudi kamulela Eliyazali</para>
  <para style="q">na Eliyazali na mweni kamulela Matani</para>
  <para style="q">na Matani kamlela Yakobi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yakobi kamulela Yosefu bambu waki Maliya na Maliya kamulela Yesu yivamkema Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi kwavelili na fileli lilongu na mchechi kukandila Ibulahimu mbaka Dawudi, Fileli lilongu mchechi tangila Dawudi mbaka kuluhamila kula Babiloni, kwaveli na fileli lilongu na mchechi kukandila kutoliwa kuyenda kula Babiloni mbaka chipindi cha Kilistu Mgombola.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwoneka kwa Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 2:1-7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Topi ndi wawonikili Yesu Kilistu. Maliya mamudu Yesu aveli nondi ya Yosefu. Ngajila tanila kumufika amanyikili kala kucha aveli na suliya yapatili kwa uwesu wa Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yosefu nondi yaki Maliya aveli goleki, alemili kumupa soni nondi waki pawelu. Kwanongwa ayi ayiholili amuleki kwa chifisu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Paghaveyi akwihola chilongu achi, topi, makungu wa Bambu kamwisila mung'onju, kamuwombela, “Yosefu wa lukolu lwa Dawudi kotoo kutila kumheta Maliya kwanongwa kana suliya kwa uwesu wa Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Dayihongeshi mwana mlumi na yuwi dawumupi litawa Yesu, kwanongwa mweni ndi davalowoli vandu vaki kufuma mu sambi shawu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi afi fyosi fiva ili chivi chila chilongu cha detili Bambu kwa lishu lya mbuyi wa Chapanga kucha, <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Muyenji dayimi yinda na daamuleli mwana mlumi na davamkemi litawa lyaki Imanueli” Mana yaki, “Chapanga kava pamu na yufwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi, Yosefu payimukili, kamuheta Maliya kucha makungu wa Bambu Chapanga wamuwombilili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yosefu kawonja ha na Maliya mbaka pawonikili mwana. Topi Yosefu kamupa litawa lya Yesu mwana yula yawonikili.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yivasikawula ndondwa kufuma kundamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu awonikili mumbwani ya Betelehemu, mumkowa wa Yudeya, chipindi cha Helodi paghavaya mutwa. tepu, vandu yivasikawula ndondwa vafikili Yelusalemu kufuma kundamba. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vadasha, “kava koti mwana yawonikili daghavi mutwa wa Vayawudi? Tuyiwona ndondwa yaki payibwitukili kundamba, tuyisa kumutundamila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mutwa Helodi papikanishili afi, ang'ong'utekili nendu, mweni pamu na vandu vosi va Yelusalemu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi, kavakema vatambika vakomi vosi pamu na vawula va Malawu kavadasha, “Kilistu Mgombola dawonikeli koti?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Veni vamuyangula, “Dawonikeli kumbwani Betelehemu, mkoa wa Yudeya. topi ndi wayandikili mbuyi wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>‘Yuwi Betelehemu mlima wa Yuda, kuva mkomi gati ya mbwani sha Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa kwa yuwi dabwituki chilongosi,</para>
  <para style="q">davalongoshi vandu vangu, Vayisilaeli.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi Helodi avakemili vasimanyili ndondwa kwa chifisu ili vamumanyishi chipindi choti nakaka ndondwa payibwitukili. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pambeli kavalayila Betelehemu padeta, “Muyendi mukakombikeshi kwa chiganu nongwa ya mwana ayu. Pamumuwona mwisi kung'ombela na nenga nyendi ngamutundamili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili kala filongu fya Mutwa vayendilela na mwanja na yila ndondwa yivayiwonili kundamba yivalongulela, payiyenda mbaka yiwoloka pambindi ya pavelili mwana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pavawonili ndondwa vasekelela munu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi vayingila munyumba, vamuwona yula mwana pamu na Maliya, vawa vamtundamila, pambeli vawopola mbembu shawu vamupa fupu: chumang'andu na ubani na mafuta vatalamili yivavakema manimani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chapanga avakayikili vala yivayisili kumlola mwana Yesu vakotoo kumuwuyila Helodi, topi vawuya kaya kupitila deha yingi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutuvilila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pavawukili kala vala vahenja, Topi makungu wa Bambu Chapanga amfumbukilili Yosefu mung'onju, kamuwombela, “Tandamuki! Umtoli mwana pamu na mamundu, mutuvili Misili mukayikali aku mbaka pandivawombela, kwanongwa Helodi akwilata amuwulayi mwana ayu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Topi Yosefu atandamukili, kamtola mwana pamu na mamundu pamihi yiyila yila, vawuka vayenda Misili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kayikala aku mbaka Helodi pasovili. Topi, chilongu chadetili Bambu kwa deha ya vambuyi wa Chapanga fiva,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ndamkemili mwana wangu kufuma Misili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Vana vadokwa valumi vakuwulayiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Helodi pamanyili kucha vala vasimanyili ndondwa vaveli vamujanga, akalalili munu. Alayishili vana valulumi vosi mumbwani ya Betelehemu na vala yivaveli mumbali mbali yaki yivaveli na myaka mivili na pasi ya mwaka mivili vawulaghiwi. Agolili nahau ngimu wakashili chipindi cha vala vasimanyili ndondwa pavadashili milandu ya mwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nahawu ndi wuyivelili chilongu chila chadetili mbuyi wa Chapanga Yelimiya,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Lishu lipikanika aku Lama,</para>
  <para style="q">chivembu na kudedeka nendu.</para>
  <para style="q">Raheli akuvalilila vana vaki.</para>
  <para style="q">Wala akudayila ha kushisha moyu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwanongwa vosi vayaghamila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Helodi asovili kala, topi makungu wa Bambu amubwitukilili Yosefu mulilotu kula Misili. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kamuwombela “Tandamuki! Mtoli mwana na mamundu muyendi Mlima wa Isilaeli, nongwa vala yivadayileyi kumuwulagha mwana ayu vasova kala.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Katandamuka kamtola mwana pamu na mamundu vawuya kumlima wa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini papikanishili kucha Alikelau aveli mutwa wa Yudeya badili ya Helodi tatimundu, aveli akutila kuyenda aku. Mweni pavamukayikili mumilotu ayendili mwambu wa Galilaya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kayenda ayikalili mumbwani ya Nazaleti nahau ndi wufivelili filongu fyawombili kwa deha ya Vambuyi “Davamkemi mundu wa Nasaleti.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kulandula kwa Yohani Mbatisha</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:1-8, Lukasi 3:1-18, Yohani 1:19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Majuva vala Yohani Mbatisha abwitukili: palandula kuchivala aku Yudeya: <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mweni kawomba, “Mupomeli sambi nongwa wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga samba wisa.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yohani ayu ndi yula Isaya yaveli mbuyi wa Chapanga yamudetili:</para>
  <para style="q">“Mundu yumu akukema kucheja:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mutandi njila ya Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q">Muhololi deha yaki.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha afwalili yingwa sivasonili kwa mingoma ya ngamia. Na lufunga lwa ngwembi muchiwunu chaki. Filivi fyaki fyaveli vangumbingumbi na njuki. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Topi, vandu kufuma Yelusalemu na kufuma mbembi shosi sha mlima wa Yudeya pamu na mbembi shosi sha mumbali mbali ya lweni Yoludani, vamuyendela. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vayipetili sambi shawu na mweni kavabatisha mulweni Yoludani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini pavawonili Mafwalisayu na Masadukayu vakumwisila ili vabatishiwi. Kavawombela, “Yumwi vanjoka! Ghani yavapwepwilili mwilyepi na asabu yiyisayi?” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mulangushi kwa fivelekwa kucha mupomela. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mukotoo kuyihola kucha damuyilyepi asabu nongwa tati wenu ndi Ibulahimu! Nguvawombela Chapanga akuwesha kuyigola migonguveli ayi yivi vana va Ibulahimu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi, livawu liva kala kudumula mikigha ya libiki, ndamboyi kila libiki lingajila kulela fivelekwa finofu likudumuliwa na kudangiwa mumotu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nenga nguvabatisha kwa machi kulangusha kucha mupomela. Lakini yula dayisi kumbeli ya nenga yaveli na liwovi pitu nenga. Nenga ngujakwa ha hata kupapa filatu fyaki. Mweni davabatishi kwa Mfuki Mng'alili na kwa motu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mweni akukamula luselu mumawoku vaki dafyaghili nendu luvagha lwaki na dakungi mbeyu shaki musanja na myeyu akwinyanya mumotu wungajila kujimika</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akubatishiwa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:16-20, Lukasi 5:1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Chipindi achi Yesu ayisili kufuma Galilaya kayenda mulweni Yoludani abatishiwi na Yohani mbatisha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini Yohani mbatisha ayeshili kumkanila padeta, “Nenga ngudayila kubatishiwa na yuwi, kandi na yuwi ukwisa kwa nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamuyangula, “Yuwi ujumili hela kwanongwa tugoli fyosi fyadayila Chapanga.” Topi Yohani ajumilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu pabatishiwi kala, bahala pala kajabuka mumachi topi kumbindi kwa Chapanga kufuwuka kamuwona Mfuki wa Chapanga pasunuka kucha njiva na kumtula pambindi yaki. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lishu kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga lideta, “Ayu ndi mwana wangu yindimtamili mayiliwa na mweni.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyeshiwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:12-13, Lukasi 4:1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Mfuki Mng'alili amulongushili Yesu mbaka kucheja ili ayeshiwi na Lijangavandu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kayikaja kulya majuva milongu mchechi pamusi na pamihi, pambeli kawona njala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi, Mwafu kamwisila, kamuwombela “Leki yuwi kuva Mwana wa Chapanga nakaka, deti migonguveli ayi yivi filivi.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Yiyandikiwa mumayandiku Vang'alili.</para>
  <para style="q">Mundu akwikala kwa kulya filivi weka hela ha,</para>
  <para style="q">ila kwa chilongu chochosi chadeta Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pambeli Lijangavandu kamtola mbaka Yelusalemu, mbwani ying'alili, kamvika pambindi ya mnala wa nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kamuwombela, “Leki nakaka yuwi kuva mwana wa Chapanga, widangi pasi, kwanongwa yiyandikiwa mumayandiku Vang'alili</para>
  <para style="q">‘Chapanga davalayishi makungu vaki vakuyangi mumawoku vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">ukotoo kuponikela mumigonguveli’”.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yiyandikiwa mumayandiku Vang'alili, ukotoo kumuyesha Chapanga, Bambu waku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pambeli Lijangavandu kamtola mbaka pambindi ya chidunda chitali, kamlangusha wutwa shosi na ukomi waki. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lijangavandu kamuwombela, “Fyosi afi ngukupa pawundundamila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kamuwombela, “Kopoki apa Lijangavandu! Yiyandikiwa mumayandiku Vang'alili mtundamili Chapanga Bambu waku na kumkimbanikila mweni hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi, Lijangavandu kawuka kamuleka Yesu na makungu vayisa, kumukimbanikila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akukanda chichuku aku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:14-15, Lukasi 4:14-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu apikanilili kucha Yohani mbatisha vamutatila muchijaka, ayendili Galilaya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Awukili Nasaleti, kayenda kwikala mumbwani ya Kapelinaumu, muluwongu ya lihiva lya Galilaya mumbaka ya wilaya ya Sebuloni na Nafutali. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ayi yagolikili ili chila chilongu chadetili mbuyi wa Chapanga Isaya chivi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mlima wa Sebuloni na mlima wa Nafutali</para>
  <para style="q">yavelili mudeha ya kuyenda kulihiva lya Galilaya mwambu ya lweni Yoludani na</para>
  <para style="q">mumlima wuvayikala vangajila kuva Vayawudi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vandu vayikalili kuchisi,</para>
  <para style="q">vawonili lwengi lukomi.</para>
  <para style="q">Na vala vayikalili mulisisi lya njifwa,</para>
  <para style="q">lwengi luvang'alikila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kukandila chipindi achi Yesu akandili kulandula, padeta, “Mupomeli, kwanongwa wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva pabehi!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakema vandundami va kwaa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:16-20, Lukasi 5:1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Yesu patyangeyi muluwongu lwa lihiva lya Galilaya, avawonili vandu vavili yivavelili ulongu. Vavelili Simoni yivamkema Petili pamu na Andeleya, vaveli mulihiva vakufuva vasomba kwa lwafu. Veni vaveli vafuva. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, mungovikeli, nenga danivagoli muvi vafuva va vandu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bahala pala, vasileka njafu shawu, vamukovikela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Payendili pawulongolu, kavawona vandu vengi vavili yivavelili ulongu, vavelili Yakobi na Yohani vana va Sebidayu, veni vavelili muwatu pamu na tati wawu pavasambula njafu shawu. Yesu kavakema. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tepu vawulekili watu pamu na tati wawu, vamukovekela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyendilela na chichuku chaki</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 6:17-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu aveli akuyendayenda mumlima wosi wa Galilaya. Pawula munyumba sha kudadavila na kulandula Chilongu cha nyanyi cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na kulowola matami kafwauti kafwauti. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Milandu yaki yakwilili mumlima wosi wa Siliya, vamuyeghela vandu vosi yivavelili na matami, vala yivavelili vakutamika na kuteshiwa, yivavelili na matami va finyamkela na chisilika na vapombalili vamuyeghilili na mweni kavalowola vosi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mipinga mikomi ya vandu yamukovikelili kufuma Galilaya na Dekapoli, mbwani yikemiwili Mbwani Lilongu na kufuma Yelusalemu na kufuma Yudeya na kufuma mbembu yingi ya Yoludani.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulandulila kwilata vagaju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu paliwonili lipinga lya vandu, akwenili kuchidunda, kayikala. Vanachuli vaki vamushengitela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pambeli kakanda kuvawula,</para>
  <para style="s">Cheleli cha nakaka</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 6:20-23</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Vanemiliwa vala yivayimanya kucha veni vakuwesha ha kwikala ngajila Chapanga!</para>
  <para style="q">Nongwa wutwa wa kumbindi ndi wawu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vanemiliwa vala yivavelili na lung'ong'u,</para>
  <para style="q">Nongwa Chapanga davavafwamushi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vanemiliwa vala vashishamoyu,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa ava ndi davahali mlima wa shonu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vanemiliwa vala yivavelili na njala na yivayikaja kulya kwanongwa ya ugoleki,</para>
  <para style="q">Chapanga davayikutishi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vanemiliwa yivaveli na lusungu,</para>
  <para style="q">Chapanga davawoneli lusungu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vanemiliwa vala yivamtama Chapanga kwa ndima yawu yosi,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa davamuwoni Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vanemiliwa vala yivavika kusika, kwanongwa davakemiwi vana va Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vanemiliwa vala vagobuleka kwanongwa ya ugoleki,</para>
  <para style="q">kwanongwa wutwa wa kumbindi ndi wa veni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Munemiliwa yumwi vandu pavavajowola na pavavasulumu na pavavapayishila findu fyosi fya wafu kwanongwa ya nenga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Musekileli na kunemelela kwanongwa fupu yenu ngomi kumbindi kwa Chapanga, nongwa pavavasulumili vambuyi ngimu yimusulumiwa ponopawu yumwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Munyu na lwengi</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 9:50, Lukasi 14:34-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta, “Yumwi muva munyu wa mlima lakini munyu pawuyaghamisha chinosi chaki dayinoghishiwi na liki? Yikujakwa chindu kandi ha, ila yikuyasiwa hela na vandu vayivatangi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Yumwi muva lwengi lwa mlima awu! Mbwani yivajengili pachidunda yikufisika ha. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu yanamika luliku na kulugubika kwa chiyungu, ila ukuluvika kumbindi ya pachindangawala ili yivang'alikili vosi yivaveli munyumba. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wuwowu luliku lwenu lulikili vandu, ili vafiwoni figoli fyenu finofu, vamujumi Tati wenu yaveli kumbindi.</para>
  <para style="s">Malawu va Chapanga na Mayandiku va Vambuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Mukotoo kwihola kucha nyisa kuwusha Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na mayandiku va vambuyi, ila nyisa kugola fivi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, kumbindi na mlima dawufipeli, lakini kwahela hata liyandiku limu wala lilawu daliwushiwi, mbaka fyosi fivi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yoyonda davifyi hata lilawu limu lidokwa pitu vosi na kuvawula vamonga vavifyi, ayu daghavi mdokwa nendu muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Lakini yula daavakamuli na kuvawula vengi, ayu daghavi mkomi muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nguvawombela, ugoleki wenu pawuyongisheka ng'odu pitu wula wa Mafwalisayu na vawula va Malawu, damuyingili ha muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mawuli yivayilata chifuki</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 12:57-59</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mupikanila kala kucha vandu va pakwandi vawombiliwili, ‘Ukotoo kuwulaya! Yula dawulayi dahighiwi.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini nenga nguvawombela, yoyosi yamukalalila mlongu mundu, ahighiwi. Yamubedala mlongu mundu dayeghiwi kuchitemela. Yamukema mlongu mundu ‘Mpufi’ kava munjifwa ya kuyingila mulifumbika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Topi, pawuyegha fupu yaku pafyalu na pawukumbuka kuva na shoshu na mlongu waku, <verse number="24" style="v"/>yileki fupu yaku pawulongolu pafyalu, yendi mukajovi tanila na mlongu waku, pambeli wuyi utawuli fupu yaku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Mjovi na muhighi waku kalopu pamuva mkali mudeha pamuyenda kuchitemela. Leki pawugola naha ng'odu muhighi waku dakuyeghi kwa muhigha na muhigha dakuyeghi kwa vadima na yuwi davakuwopi muchijaka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nakaka ngukuwombela, dawufumi ng'odu mula mbaka uhombi ligwala lya mwishu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha uwoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Mupikanisha kucha vandu vavawombilili, ‘Mukotoo kugola uwoni!’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini nenga nguvawombela, yamulola mdadala kwa dobukelu, kawonja nayu kala mundima yaki. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Topi, lisu lyaku lya mlilu palikugola ugoli uvifyi, wulikolopoli kaliyasili kutali. Ngiba yuwi uyaghamishi chimu mumvili waku, pitu kuyasa mvili waku wonda mulifumbika. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kucha liwoku lyaku lya mlilu palikuvifya, ulidumuli uliyasi kutali. Ngiba yuwi uyaghamishi chindu chimu cha mvili waku pitu mvili waku wosi ugwijuki mulifumbika.”</para>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 18:9, Maliku 10:11-12, Lukasi 16:18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Yiwombiwa kala, ‘mundu yamuleka mwehi waki, yamugayilili talaka.’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini nenga nguvawombela, yamugayila mwehi mundu talaka ila kwanongwa yoyosi yingajila uwoni akuvifya kumugola ayu mdala agoli uwoni. Pambeli mlumi yamuheta mdala yula alekiwili na mweni akugola uwoni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya malapu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kandi mupikanila kucha vandu va pakwandi vawombiwili, ‘Ukotoo kuleka malapu vaku, lakini ugoli malapu vaku kwa Bambu.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini nenga nguvawombela, mukotoo kwilapa, kwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, kwanongwa chila ndi chigoda cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kandi mukotoo <note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:35 </char></note>kwilapa pamlima kwanongwa ndi chigoda chaki cha kuvikila mawulu na mukotoo kwilapa hata kwa Yelusalemu kwanongwa ndi mbwani ya wutwa mkomi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kandi kotoo kwilapa kwa mutwi waku kwanongwa ukuwesha ha kulugola lufwili lumu luvi lukeli awu lutitu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pawudeta, ‘yina’ yivi yina na ‘Ng'odu’ yivi ng'odu topi chochosi dachiyongisheki chikufuma kwa yula mwafu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ulilu yisiyilata Lugotu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 6:29-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Mupikanisha kucha yideteka, ‘Lisu kwa lisu, linu kwa linu.’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lakini nenga nguvawombela, ukotoo kumugolela Lugotu mundu mwafu. Mundu pakuvangula likanja lya mlilu mughalambulili na likanja lya mkiyi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mundu pakuyegha kuchitemela kucha kakutolela gwanda yaku, mleki atoli na lihabiti lyaku. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mundu pakung'ang'anika kupapa msiwu waki mwanja wumu, yuwi yendi kavili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mundu pakakuluva umupi, kotoo kumupa chisowu mundu yadayila kukopa chindu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuvatama vachimdwama</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 6:27-28, Lukasi 6:32-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Mpikana kucha vadeta, ‘Mtami mjofi waku na kumunyekwa chimudwama waku.’ <verse number="44" style="v"/>Lakini nenga nguvawombela muvatami vachimdwama venu na kuvadadavila kwa Chapanga vala yivavasulumu yumwi. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ili muvi vana va Tati wenu yaveli kumbindi. Kwanongwa mweni akuvavalila lijuva vandu vawafu na vanofu na kuvatonyela ndonya vandu goleki na va wafu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Damupati fupu liki kwa kuvatama vala yivavatama yumwi hela? Kwahela! Kwanongwa hata vala vasumula vakugola wuwowu! <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kucha pamuvajambusha vaghanja venu hela, mukugola chindu ng'odu? Hata vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga vakugola wuwu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Topi mugoleki vasangi kucha Tati wenu yaveli kumbindi waveli msangi.”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvatanga vagaju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Mwivavali mukotoo kugola figoli fyenu fya ugoleki pawulongulu ya vandu ili mumanyiki. Pamugola naha Tati wenu yaveli kumbindi davapi ng'odu fupu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Topi pawumtanga mgaju, kotoo kulandusha kwa vandu. Kotoo kugola kucha mfyangu wagola munyumba sha kudadavila na mudeha ili vandu vavajumi. Nakaka nguvawombela, ava vapata kala fupu shawu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lakini yumwi pamuvatanga vagaju, hata wa chimbundi chimu akotoo kumanya, lakini pawumtanga, hata mundu yuummanyili akotoo kumanya chiwugolili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Tawuli utangi waku kwa chifisu na tati waku yalola findu fifisikili fiwugola, dakufupi.</para>
  <para style="s">Fiyilata kudadava</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 11:2-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Pamudadava mukotoo kugola kucha vafyangu. Veni vakudayila kuwoloka na kudadava munyumba sha kudadavila na mumaleka ili vandu vavaloli, nakaka muvawombeli ava vapata kala fupu shawu shosi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lakini yuwi pawudadava, wingili munyumba yaku, tati mlyangu, pambeli muluvi Tati waku yangajila kuwoneka. Na mweni yalola fifisikili daakufupi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Pamudadava, mukotoo kudeta fitangalili fingajila nongwa kucha vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga. Veni vakwihola kucha vamulungu vawu daavapikanishi kwanongwa ya filongu fyawu fitangalili. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mukotoo kuva kucha veni. Tati wenu kamanya fimudayila hata yumwi mukalihela kumuluva. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi, tudadavi nga nahawu.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Tati wetu yuuveli kumbindi,</para>
  <para style="q">litawa lyaku lijumiwi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wutwa waku wisi,</para>
  <para style="q">liwudayila ligoleki apa pamlima ngimu wuligoleka kula kumbindi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Utugayili filivi fya nalelu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tupomeli fituvifyili,</para>
  <para style="q">ngimu yufwi wutuvapomela vala vatuvifyili.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kotoo kututaya munyeshiwu,</para>
  <para style="q">lakini wutuwilyepeshi na yula mwafu. Kwanongwa wutwa ndi waku na liwovi na ukomi mbaka jola. Yina.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Kwanongwa pamuvapomela vandu fyavavifyili na yumwi wuwowu Tati wenu wa kumbindi davapomeli. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini pamuvapomela ng'odu vandu fyavavifyili na yumwi Tati wenu davapomeli ng'odu fimuvifyili.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwikaja kulya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Pamuyikaja kulya, mukotoo kuva na lung'ongu kucha vafyangu, veni vakukikinala kuwushu ili vandu vavawoni kucha veni vakwikaja kulya, nguvawombela nakaka, ava vapata kala fupu yawu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini yuwi pawuyikaja kulya navi wushu waku na shaghi mafuta mutwi waku, <verse number="18" style="v"/>ili mundu yoyosi akotoo kumanya kucha yuwi ukwikaja kulya. Ili umanyiki hela na Tati waku yangajila kuwoneka na yalola fifisikili na mweni dakugayili fupu.</para>
  <para style="s">Lusanja kumbindi kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Mukotoo kulunda mali apa pamlima pavelili sondu na kutu fikuyananga na vefi vakwingila na kuhija. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mulundi mali kumbindi kwa Chapanga kungajila sondu na kutu ya kuyananga, wala vefi kuyingila na kuhija. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa pala pawulundili mali shaku na moyu waku dawuvi bahala.</para>
  <para style="s">Lwengi lwa mvili</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 11:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Lisu kucha lwengi lwa mvili waku. Leki lisu lyaku linofu na mvili waku wosi dawuvi mulwengi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini lisu lyaku palivifya, muvili waku wosi dawuvi mulwisa. Topi, payiva lwengi luveli mugati yaku luva mulwisa, topi ndi lwisa totolu!</para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga na mali</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 16:13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kwahela mundu yawesha kuvakimbanikila vabambu vavili. Mana damuleki yumu na kumutama yula monga, awu damukovikeli yumu na kumubedala yula yumu. Muweshi ng'odu kumukimbanikila Chapanga na mbiya kwa chipindi chimu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mukotoo kuva na chipwembwi</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 12:22-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Ndi nongwa nguvawombela, mukotoo kuva na chipwembwi kucha damulyi liki na damlandi liki ili mwikali awu kucha damufwali yingwa liki, unofu ndi utalama pitu filivi. Na mvili utalama pitu filivi na yingwa? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Muvaloli vambongu, vakukweta ng'odu, wala vakubena ng'odu na vavahela lusanja. Hata naha, Tati wenu wa kumbindi akuvakutisha. Topi, yumwi mtalama pitu ava. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wuli? Ghani gati ya yumwi kwanongwa ya chipwembwi chikomi, akuwesha kuyongesha mweni majuva va kuyikala? <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nongwa liki mukuyihola kuyilata yingwa? Muloli uluva ndambu yiwukula na pawunemuna. Wukugola ha chichuku wala kugola. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini nguvawombela, hata Solumoni mweni na ulundamali waki wosi kafwala kamu ha fivayilili kucha uluva wumu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Leki payiva Chapanga akulifwalisha lidasi livelili nalelu na chilawu likuyasiwa mumotu, ponopa akuvagolela yumwi vandu finofu nendu? Yumwi vandu yimuvelili na ujumilwa mdokwa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Topi, mukotoo kuyihosha kucha ‘datulyi liki? Datulandi liki? Na datufwali liki? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nongwa fyosi afi ndi fikudayiliwa na vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga. Lakini yumwi Tati wenu wa kumbindi kamanya kucha mukudayila findu fyosi afi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Topi, muyiholi tanila wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na fila fyadayila Chapanga na mweni davagayili fimonga fyosi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Topi, mukotoo kuva na chipwembwi kwa chilawu, chilawu kuuveli msayisayi waki. Misayisayi ya lijuva limu, vakukwila kwa lijuva ali.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvahigha vayenu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 6:37-38, Lukasi 6:41-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Mukotoo kuvahigha vengi na yumwi damuhighiwi na Chapanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chapanga davahighi yumwi nga wuwula wula wumuvahigha vayenu na chigelu chichila chila chimuvalingilili vayenu na Chapanga daavalingili yumwi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nongwa liki ukuchiwona chibandi chiveli mulisu lya mlongu waku, lakini yikukupota kulola libalu livelili mulisu lyaku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ukuwesha wuliwuli kumuwombela mlongu waku kucha, ‘Leki nguwushi chibandi chiveli mulisu lyaku,’ kunu umweni kuna libalu mulisu lyaku? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yuwi mfyangu! Wushi tanila libalu livelili mulisu lyaku pambeli leki uchiwoni chibandi chivelili mulisu lya mlongu waku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Mukotoo kuvapa vagalu findu fing'alili vakuwesha kughalambuka na kuvakapula mwaveni, wala mukotoo kuvayasila vangubi findu fitawukili vakuwesha kufivatanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Luvi na saki na kuti mlyangu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 11:9-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Muluvi damugayiliwi, musaki damupati, mkuti mlyangu damufuwuliwi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa yaluva akugayiliwa na yasaka dapati na yakuta mlyangu dafuwuliwi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wuli, kwaveli mundu yoyosi mwanamundu pamuluva filivi, damupi ligonguveli? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Awu pakaluva somba, damupi njoka? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi yumwi muva vandu va wafu mumanya kuvagayila vana venu findu finofu nakaka Tati wenu wa kumbindi, davagoleli yumwi nendu, davapi findu fya nyanyi vala vandu vosi yivamuluva!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Fyosi fimudayila vandu vavagoleli yumwi, muvagoleli wuwowu veni, ayi ndi nongwa ya Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa na ng'ulilu ya vambuyi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mlyangu unyepili</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 13:24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mwingili kwa kupitila mlyangu wunyepili. Kwa nongwa deha yiyenda kulifumbika lingajila kujima ngomi na mlyangu wa kuyingililila amu umanuka na yivayenda deha ayi vatangala. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lakini deha yiyenda kuunofu yiva dokwa na mlyangu wa kwingilila unyepa, vandu vadokwa hela davayiwoni deha ayi.</para>
  <para style="s">Libiki na fivelekwa fyaki</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 6:43-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mwikali mesu na vambuyi va udesi. Ava vakwisa kwa yumwi vakuva kucha vafungami kwa kuvalola, lakini mugati fingekembi fikalipili. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Damuvamanyi kwa fila fivagola. Wuli, vandu vakunokola mindopi mumibiki ya misomi, awu ukuwesha kusola mikuyu mumitalula? Ng'odu! <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi libiki linofu likuveleka fivelekwa finofu na libiki lya wafu likuveleka fivelekwa fya wafu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Libiki linofu likuwesha ng'odu kuveleka fivelekwa fya wafu, wala libiki lya wafu likuveleka fivelekwa finofu ha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Libiki lingajila kuveleka fivelekwa finofu dandilidumuli na kuliyasila mumotu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ponopa damuvamanyi vambuyi va udesi kwa fila fivagola.</para>
  <para style="s">Yumwi ndivamanya ng'odu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 13:25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mundu yoyosi yangema nenga ‘Bambu, Bambu,’ Dayingili muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ha, yuyula weka yagola fila fyadayilili Tati wangu yaveli kumbindi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lijuva lya kuhigha vatangalili davang'ombeli, Bambu, Bambu! Twalandulili filongu fyaku kwa litawa lyaku na kwa litawa lyaku twavawushili finyamkela na kugola mihilu yitangalili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi, dandivawombeli: ‘Yumwi ndivamanya ng'odu muwuki, muwuki pawulongolu yangu, yumwi yimushovilelili kugola fya wafu.’</para>
  <para style="s">Vajengi vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 6:47-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ponopa mundu yoyosi yapikanisha filongu fyangu na kufikola, akwifwana na mundu yaveli na luhunja. Yajengili nyumba yaki pambindi ya ligonguveli. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ndonya yitonya na nyeni siyitika liyegha lipugha na kuwumbila kunyumba ayi. Lakini yiwa ha kwanongwa vajengili pambindi ya ligonguveli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Lakini yoyosi yapikanisha filongu fyangu ngajila kufikola, akwifwana na mundu mpufi yajengili nyumba yaki mumuhanga. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ndonya payitonyili na nyeni pasiyitikili na likumba palipughili na kulifikila nyumba ayi, yeni yiwa, kandi yiwa chakachaka!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ukomi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu pamalilili kudeta filongu fila, lipinga lya vandu lijingwa na ng'ulilu yaki. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kava kucha vawula vawu va Malawu ha, ila awulili kwa ukomi.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mundu yapombalili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:40-45, Lukasi 5:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pasunukili kuchidunda, fipinga fya vandu fyamkovikelili. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ayisili mundu yumu yaveli na ukalava. Kamugondamila padeta, “Bambu, pawudayila ukuwesha kung'ofuwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu katola liwoku lyaki kamugufya pambeli kudeta, “Ngudayila! yuwi ung'ofuwi.” Tepu mundu yula kalowoka utami waki wa mwiku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamuwombela, “Pikani, kotoo kumuwombela mundu, yendi kayilangushi kwa mtambika na kutawula litambiku lilayishilwi na Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa kutovilela kucha nakaka kunana.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulowola mundu yapombalili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:40-45, Lukasi 5:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu payingileyi mumbwani ya Kapelinaumu mundu yumu mkomi wa machonda amuyendilili, kamuluva, <verse number="6" style="v"/>Padeta, “Bambu ndumindumi wangu kawonja kaya mtami wa kupombala na akutamika nendu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kawomba, “Ngwisa kumulowola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mundu yula mkomi wa machonda kamuwombela, “Bambu, yuwi ukujakwa ha kuyingila munyumba yangu. Lakini deti chilongu hela na ndumindumi wangu danani. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa hata nenga mundu yimeli pasi ya ukomi wa vandu vamonga, ndiva nawu vamachonda vaveli pasi ya nenga. Pandimuwombela yumu, ‘Yendi!’ Na mweni akuyenda: na mumonga, ‘wisi!’ Na mweni akwisa na ndumindumi wangu, ‘Goli chindu achi!’ Mweni akugola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu papikanishili afi, kayikanganika, kavawombela vandu vamkovikeli nakaka nguvawombela ngalihela kumuwona mundu yoyosi Muyisilaeli yaveli na ujumilwa kucha awu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Topi, nguvawombela kucha vandu vatangalili vakwisa kufuma kundamba na kuuhehi na veni vakwikala palihungu pamu na Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobi muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini vala yivadayiliwa kuva muwutwa awu davadangiwi panji, mulwisa, aku davalili na kugelujula minu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamuwombela yula machonda wa Loma, “Yendi kaya na yivi kucha wujumilili.”</para>
  <para style="p">Ndumindumi waki ananili mwanja wuwula.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vandu vatangalili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 1:24-34, Lukasi 4:38-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu afikili kaya ya Petili, kamuwona mkohanu mundu Petili kawonja pawulili kana msusa mkomi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kamugufya liwoku mawu yula na msusa wumuleka, pambeli kayimuka kamukimbanikila. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Payiveyi palumii, vamuyeghilili vandu vatangalili yivakamuliwili na finyamkela. Na mweni kwa kudeta chilongu hela, kafivinga fila finyamkela fyosi, avalowulili kandi vandu vosi vaveli vatami. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Agolili naha ili fila fyadetili mbuyi Isaya fivi nakaka, “Mweni bahala kawutola usosuvafu wetu kavawusha matami vetu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yivadayiliwa kumkovikela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 9:57-62</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu paliwonili lipinga lya vandu limshengetela, avalayishili vanachuli vaki vayendi kumwambu ya lihiva. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Muwula yumu wa Malawu, kamuyendela Yesu kamuwombela, “Muwula, nenga dandikukovikeli kosi kuuyenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Fingekembi vana mbaku na vambongu vana fiyumba, lakini mwana wa mundu kavahela mahali pa kwikala na kupumulila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pambeli mundu wingi pagati ya vanachuli vaki kamuwombela, “Bambu uneki tanila ngamusiki Tati wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamuwombela, “Ungovikeli! Wuvaleki yivasovili vavasiki yivasovili vayawu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulilakalila liwumbula linyamali</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 4:35-41, Lukasi 8:22-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kayipaka muwatu pamu na vanachuli vaki vayenda. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tepu liwumbula likomi likanda mulihiva, mbaka majinga vakanda kudibasha watu. Mwanja wula Yesu aveli mung'onju. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vanachuli vamuyendela, vamuyimushi kunu pavadeta “Tulowoli Bambu tukusova!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yumwi vandu yimuveli na ujumilwa mdokwa mbona mukutila?” Topi katandamuka, kalilakalila liwumbula na liyegha kuva nyanyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vandu vayikanganika, vadeta, “Mundu ayu wa wuliwuli? Hata liyegha na liwumbula likumpikana!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vandu vavili yivaveli na finyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 5:1-20, Lukasi 8:26-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu pafikili mumlima wa Vagadala kumwambu ya lihiva, aku atang'anikili na vandu vavili yivafumeyi kusembi sha mbaku. Vandu ava vavelili na finyamkela na vaveli vakukapusha nendu kwahela mundu yayeshili kupita njila yila. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tepu veni vakanda kuwuta, “Ukudayila liki kwa yufwi, yuwi mwana na Chapanga? Kwisa kutugobola chipindi cheni chikali kwisa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pabehi na pala pavelili lipinga likomi lya vangubi vakulya. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Topi, vala finyamkela vamuluva Yesu, “Mani pawutuwusha, tujumishi tuyingili mulipinga lya vangubi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Topi muyendi.” Topi, vavafuma vandu vala na kuvayingila vangubi. Lipinga lyosi lya vangubi liwulumbuka mbilu vaseleka muchiseleka chikali na kudubukila mulihiva vangubi vosi vafwa machi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na vala vadima vangubi vatuvili vayenda kumbwani. Aku valandula milandu yosi yigolikili na vandu vala vaveli na finyamkela. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Topi vandu vosi va mlima wula vafumili, vamuyendela Yesu, pavamuwonili, vamuluva awuki mumlima wau.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumulowola mundu yapombalili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 2:1-12, Lukasi 5:17-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kayipaka muwatu, kajabuka lihiva kuwuya kwayikaleyi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aku vandu vamuyeghilili mundu yumu yapombalili muvili, vamuwonjesha muulili. Yesu pawonili ujumilwa wawu, kamuwombela mundu yula yapombalili, “Mwana wangu wuyikangashi! Kupomiliwa sambi shaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vawuli vamu va Malawu vakandili kuyiwombela veni, “Mundu ayu akumduka Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu asimanyili kala hoshu shawu, kadeta, “Kwa nongwa liki mukwihosha fya wafu mundima shenu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lyoti lipusukili nendu, kudeta, ‘kupomiliwa sambi shaku’, awu kudeta, ‘Woloki yendi yendi?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ponopa ngudayila mumanyi kucha Mwana wa Mundu kana uwesu wa kupomela vandu sambi mumlima awu.” Topi kamuwombela yula mundu yapombalili. “Tandamuki, toli ulili waku yendi kaya yaku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mundu yula yapombalili katandamuka, kayenda kaya yaki. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vandu vosi mulipinga lila pavawonili afi, vajinga na kutila, vamujuma Chapanga yavapili vandu uwesu nga awu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mateyi akukemiwa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 2:13-17, Lukasi 5:27-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kawuka pala, paghaveyi akuyenda, amuwonili mundu yumu yakemiwa Mateyi, ayikalili pachichuku chaki cha kusumula mbiya. Topi Yesu kamuwombela, “Ungovikeli.”</para>
  <para style="q">Mateyi katandamuka, kamukovekela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi pakaya pa Mateyi paghalya filivi, vala vandu vasumula mbiya vatangalili na vandu vaveli na sambi vayisili vayikala pamu na vanachuli vaki. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vamu pavavawonili, vavadashili vanachuli vaki, “Mbona muwula wenu akulya pamu na vala vasumula mbiya na vaveli na sambi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu kavapikana, kavayangula, “Vandu vaveli vanofu vakumdayila mwilwana ha, yivamdayila mwilwana vala vavelili vatami. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi, mukayiwuli nongwa ya mayandiku yivawombili Chapanga, ‘Ngudaya lusungu hela, litambiku lya vang'ongolu ha.’ Nenga nyisa ha kuvakema yivayihola vanofu, ila yivaveli na sambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ndambu ya kwikaja kulya</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 2:18-22, Lukasi 5:33-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pambeli vanachuli va Yohani mbatisha vayendili kwa Yesu, vamudasha, “Yufwi tukuyikaja myanja yitangalili kulya na Mafwalisayu vakwikaja kulya myanja yitangalili, mbona vanachuli vaku vakwikaja kulya ng'odu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Valalikiwili kulihungu lya kuheta vakudayiliwa kulila kwa kuyidedeka chipindi Bambu wa lihungu kava pamu na veni? Mani ng'odu! Chipindi dachifiki yaheta pawushiwa pagati yawu, chipindi achi ndi davayikaji kulya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Vandu vakuvika chilepa cha yingwa ya shonu muyingwa ngulungulu ha. Nongwa chilepa achi dachinyopoli yingwa ngulungulu na pala pasakalili dapayongisheki. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwahela vandu yivavika difwayi ya shonu mumihaku ya dahili. Leki pavagola naha mihaku dayibaluki na difwayi dawuyitiki na mijamanda dayiyanangiki, ila vandu vakuvika difwayi wa shonu mumijamanda ya shonu na yosi mivili yikwikala unofu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kamwali wa ofisa na mawu yumu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 5:21-43, Lukasi 8:40-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akudeta afi, mkomi yumu Myawudi afikili, kamugondamila kunu padeta, “Kamwali wangu kasova ponopawu. Lakini deku tuyendi ukamuvikili liwoku lyaku na mweni danani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawuka pamu na vanachuli vaki, vamukovikela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mawu yumu mtami wa liholuveya kwa chipindi cha myaka lilongu na mivili, kamukovekela Yesu kumbeli, kagufya luviniku lwa yingwa yaki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Agolili nawula kwanongwa ayihoshili mundima yaki, “Pagufya hela yingwa yaki danani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu kaghalambuka kamuwona kamuwombela, “Kamwali, wuyikangashi ujumilwa waku wukulowola.” Mawu yula kanana mwanja wuwula wula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayingila munyumba ya yula mkomi. Pavamuwonili vakuva lindenda lipinga lya vandu likanda kulila, <verse number="24" style="v"/>kadeta, “Muwukepa! Muhinja ayu kasova ng'odu, kawonja hela!” Veni vamuseka. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Topi lipinga lya vandu pavaliwushili, Yesu kayingila mugati, kamukola liwoku muhija yula na mweni kawoloka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Milandu yila yikwila ngengelekwa yosi yila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vangalimesu vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kawuka pala, paghaveyi akuyenda, vangalimesu vavili vamkovekelili kunu pavavika umatu, “Mwana wa Dawudi, utuwoneli lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu pafikili kaya, vangalimesu vala vavili vamuyendela, mweni kavadasha, “Mukujumila kucha nguwesha kuvagolela chilongu achi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Veni vamuyangula, “Yina Bambu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pavayangulili naha, Yesu kavagufya mesu vawu, kadeta, “Na yivi ngimu wumujumilili!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na mesu vawu vafuwuka valola. Yesu kavakayika kwa kuvalakalila, “Mukotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyosi chilongu achi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lakini veni vawuka, vakwisha filongu fya Yesu mumlima wula wosi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola ngadeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vandu pavawukeyi, vamonga vamuyeghilili Yesu mundu yumu ngadeta kwanongwa aveli na chinyamkela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tepu, mundu yula pawushiwili chinyamkela, yula yaghaveyi ngadeta, kakanda kudeta. Vandu vajinga na kudeta, chindu nga achi chikalihela kuwoneka Muisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lakini Mafwalisayu vakudeta, “Akuvavinga finyamkela kwa liwovi lya mkomi wa finyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Fibeni fitangala vabeni vadokwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu ayendili mumbwani na fijiji, pawula munyumba shawu sha Chapanga kunu palandula milandu minofu ya Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na kulowola matami vosi na usosuvafu wa ndambu shosi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Topi, pavawonili vandu lipinga kwa lipinga, avawonilili lusungu kwanongwa vaveli takitaki na chivakolili chipwembwi kucha cha vafungami vangajila mdimi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pala kavawombela vanachuli vaki, “Fibeni fitangala, lakini vabeni vadokwa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Topi, mumuluvi Bambu wa fibeni ayeghi vabeni vatangalili vabeni fibeni fyaki.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Vandundami lilongu na mivili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 3:13-19, Lukasi 6:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu avakemili pamu vanachuli vaki lilongu na vavili, kavapa uwesu wa kuvavinga fuki sha wafu na kulowola yivavelili na mususa na matami vosi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Matawa va ava Vandundami lilongu na vavili ndi ava, Simoni yivamkema Petili na mlongu mundu Andeleya. Yakobi mwana wa Sebidayu na mlongu mundu Yohani. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Filipu na Batulumeyu na Tomasi na Mateyi yaveli msumula mbiya, Yakobi mwana waki Alufayu na Tadeyu, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Simoni yayitashila mlima na Yudasi Sikaliyoti yamshengetili Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalayisha Vandundami lilongu na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 6:7-13, Lukasi 9:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu avalayishili ava lilongu na vavili na kuvapa Malawu ava, “Mukotoo kuyenda kwa vangutungu, na mukotoo kuyingila mumbwani sha Vasamaliya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ila muyendi kwa vafungami va Isilaeli yivayaghamilili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pamuyenda muvalandulili naha, ‘Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva pabehi!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Muvalowoli vatami na mushukushi yivasovili na muvang'alishi yivaveli na utami wa mwiku na muwushi finyamkela. Mupata hela na yumwi muvapi hela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Mukotoo kutola fyumang'andu munjavi shenu, wala mbiya, awu migwala ya shaba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mukotoo kutola muhaku wa kupapila, wala likoti limonga, wala filatu, wala lukweku, nongwa mugola chichuku akudayiliwa ijala yaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Pamuyingila mumbwani awu chijiji chochosi mumusaki mundu wa kumutyangila na mwikali amu mbaka lijuva damuwuki pala. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pamuyingila munyumba muvachi, kusika yivi na yumwi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Leki venikaya pavavayanga, kusika kwenu dakuvi pamu na veni. Lakini pavavayanga ng'odu, topi sika yenu dayivawuyili mwaveni. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kucha mundu yoyosi palema kuvalibushila awu kuvapikanisha, topi pamufuma munyumba yila awu mbwani yila, mupundi lifu mumawulu yenu yivi chilangushilu cha napilu yenu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, lijuva lya highilu vandu va mbwani ayi davapati asabu ngomi pitu yila yivapatili vandu va Sodoma na Gomola.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwisa kwa gobuleku</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 13:9-13, Lukasi 21:12-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Mpikanishi! Ponopa nenga nguvalayisha yumwi kucha vafungami gati ya fingekembi. Muvi na luhunja kucha njoka na vashishamoyu moyu kucha vanjiva. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Muyivavali, nongwa davavayeghi yumwi kuchitemela na kuvalatula ndomondu munyumba shawu sha kudadavila. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Davavayeghi pawulongolu ya vatavala na vatwa kwanongwa ya nenga, ili mundovileli kwa veni na kwa vandu vamonga vangajila kuva Vayawudi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Topi, yumwi pavavayegha mubalasa, mukotoo kuyihola kucha damudeti liki na damudeti wuliwuli, tepu damugayiliwi fya kudeta. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mana damudeti yumwi ha, ila Mfuki wa Tati wenu ndi yadeta kupitila yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mlongu damushengeti mlongu mundu awulayiwi na Tati damshengeti mwana mundu na vana davavalimbi valeli vawu na kuvagola vawulayiwi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vandu vosi davavanyekwi yumwi kwanongwa ya litawa lyangu. Lakini yayiwunishila mbaka mbelu, ndi dalowuliwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Vandu pavavagobola mumbwani yimu, mutuvilili mbwani yingi. Nakaka nguvawombela, damumalili ha ndyangilu yenu mumbwani shosi sha Isilaeli ngajila mwana wa mundu kufika tanila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Mwanachuli ampiti ha muwula waki, wala ndumindumi ampiti Bambu mundu ha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yikwila mwanachuli kuva kucha muwula waki na ndumindumi kuva kucha Bambu mundu. Leki mkomi wa nyumba vamukema Besibuli, vana va muna nyumba davakemiwi matawa va wafu nendu!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yadayiliwa kutiliwa</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 12:2-7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Topi, mukotoo kuvatila vandu ava. Chindu chochosi chigubikiwili dachigubutuliwili na chindu chifisiwili dachilangushiwi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Chindivawombela yumwi mulwisa, muchideti pangesha na chilongu muchipikanishili mumbwepu, muchilandushi pachisuwulu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mukotoo kuvatila vala yivawulagha muvili, lakini vakuwesha ha kuwulagha ndima. Ngiba munu kumtila Chapanga nongwa mweni akuwesha kuwulagha mvili pamu na ndima mumotu wa lifumbika. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vamkongujoli vavili vakuhemishiwa kwa ligwala lidokwa limu. Lakini hata yumu akuponeka ha pasi ngajila Tati wenu kumanya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini kwa mwambu wenu, hata fwili sha mitwi yenu sivalangiwa shosi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ponopa mukotoo kutila, yumwi muna nongwa pitu mkongujoli vatangalili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kumjumila na kumlema Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 12:8-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Mundu yajumila pawelu kucha mweni wa nenga na nenga dandimjumili pawulongolu ya Tati wangu yaveli kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lakini yoyosi yanema pawulongolu ya vandu na nenga dandimlemi paulongolu ya Tati wangu yaveli kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Shoshu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 12:8-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mukotoo kwihola kucha nyisa kuyegha kusika pamlima awu, nyisa kuyegha kusika ha ila upanga. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mana nyisa kuyegha shoshu kwa mundu na Tati mundu, kwa kamwali na mawaki na mkohanu na mkohanumundu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na chimdwama wa mundu, ndi mundu wa kayaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Yamutama Tati awu mamundu pitu nenga, akudayiliwa ha. Na yamtama kamwali awu mwana waki akujumiliwa ha kuva ndundami. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mundu yangajila kutola lupingika lyaki na kungovikela, akudayiliwa ha kuva ndumindumi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yakamulila unofu waki, dayaghamishi, lakini yayaghamisha unofu waki kwanongwa ya nenga dawupati.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Yavapokela yumwi, akumbokela nenga na yambokela nenga akumpokela yula yanayishili. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yamupokela mbuyi wa Chapanga kwanongwa ndi mbuyi, dapokeli fupu ya mbuyi. Yamulibushila mundu msangi kwanongwa ndi mundu msangi, dapokeli fupu ya mundu goleki. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, yoyosi damupi mundu mudokwa gati ya vanachuli ava lwindi lwa machi vasisimili kwanongwa kava mundu wa nenga nakaka dayimpoti ha kupokela fupu yaki.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Malawu va Yohani Mbatisha</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 7:18-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pamalilili kuvawombela naha vala vanachuli vaki lilongu na vavili, awukili pala, kayenda kuwula na kulandula mumbwani sha behi na kula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha paghaveyi muchijaka apikanishili milandu yagolili Kilistu, topi, Yohani kavalayisha vanachuli vaki vayendi kwa Kilistu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vamudashi, “Yuwi kuva yula Yohani adetili dawisi, awu tumulembileli wingi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Muyendi mukamuwombeli Yohani mbatisha filongu fimupikana na kufiwona, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vangalimesu vakulola na vandevindevi vakuyendayenda. Vaveli na utami wa mwiku vakung'ala na majogu vakupikana. Vasovili vakushukushiwa na vagaju vakulanduliwa Chilongu cha Nyanyi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ngiba mundu yula yaveli na cheleli yangajila njelangu na nenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi vala valayiliwili na Yohani mbatisha pavawukeyi, Yesu akandili kuliwombela lipinga lya vandu nongwa ya Yohani mbatisha: “Pamuyendili kuchivala kumulola Yohani mukadayileyi kulola chindu liki? Mukadayileyi kulola liteti palitikanyishwa na liyegha? Ng'odu! <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ponopa mukayendili kulola mundu wa wuliwuli? Wuli mukayiholili mwayendili kumulola mundu yafwalili yingwa sha nyanyi? Ng'odu! Vandu vakufwala yingwa sivayilili vakwikala munyumba sha vatwa! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini, mukayendili kulola liki? Mbuyi? Yina nakaka mundu pitu mbuyi wa chapanga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ayu ndi yivamuhimula mumayandiku vang'alili.</para>
  <para style="q">‘Loli, nenga ngumlayisha makungu wangu akulonguleli,</para>
  <para style="q">mweni dakutandili deha yaku:’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela gati ya vandu vosi yivaikalili, kwa hela yawonikili kuva mkomi pitu Yohani mbatisha. Hata naha, yula yaveli mdokwa muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, ndi mkomi pitu Yohani. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tangila chipindi cha Yohani mbatisha mbaka nalelu, wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wukulevangiwa nendu na vandu vakali vakuyesha kuwutola kwa liwovi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngulilu shosi sha vambuyi va Chapanga na Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa vahimulilagha milandu ya Wutwa mbaka chipindi cha Yohani mbatisha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Leki pamuwesha kujumila, topi Yohani ndi Eliya amuhimulileyi kwisa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Muna majeji vakupikanila apikani!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Topi, dachiyifwani na chindu liki chileli achi? Kucha fijana vaveli vayikala paluvagha, pavayiwombela lipinga limu kwa lipinga limonga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>‘Tuvakuvila ngoma lakini mufina ha!</para>
  <para style="q">Tusomola misambu ya lung'ong'u, lakini mulila ha!’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa Yohani mbatisha ayisili, ayikajili kulya na wala kulanda difwayi ha, lakini veni vawomba kana chinyamkela. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwana wa mundu ayisili, akulya na kulanda na veni vadeta, ‘Mumloli ayu, mbafu na njayila, ghanja wawu vandu vasumula mbiya na vaveli na sambi!’ Hata naha luhunja lwa Chapanga lukuwoneka ilinganila kwa findu figolikili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbwani yingajila kujumila</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 10:13-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vandu va mumbwani sila Yesu shagolili mihilu yitangalili vapomela ha, topi Yesu awukili mumbwani sila. <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Pishu yuwi Kolosayi! Pishu yuwi Betisayida! Nongwa, mihilu yigolikili kwa yumwi yingagolikili kula Tilu na Sidoni, vandu vaki vangafwalili kala milobota dahili na kuyibunga lifu pavapomela sambi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hata naha, nguvawombela nakaka, lijuva lya highilu yumwi damupati asabu ngomi pitu yila ya Tilu na mlima wa Sidoni. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Na yuwi Kapelinaumu! Wuli ukwihola dawuyikweshi mbaka kumbindi kwa Chapanga? Dawutengelimuliwi mbaka kumambi! Mana leki mihilu yigolikili kwa yuwi yingagolikili kula Sodoma, mlima wula wungavelili mbaka nalelu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini nguvawombela nakaka, lijuva lya highilu yuwi dawupati asabu ngomi pitu yila ya Sodoma.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwisi kwa nenga mupumulili</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 10:21-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Chipindechi Yesu adetili, ngukulumba yuwi Tati, Bambu wa kumbindi na mlimawu, nongwa kuvafisa yivavelili na luhunja na yivasomili findu afi, kuvagubutulila yivangajila kusoma. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yina, Tati nahawu ndi yikunowilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Tati wangu kanyimba findu fyosi. Kwahela yamumanyili Mwana ila Tati, wala kwahela yamumanyili Tati ila Mwana na mundu yoyosi yula Mwana padayila kumgubutulila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Mwisi kwa nenga yumwi mwavosi yimutofili kwa kwitwika misiwu misitu na nenga dandivagoli mupumulili. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mwiwopi lingongola yangu na mwiwuli kwa nenga, nongwa nenga ndi msangi na mshisha moyu na yumwi damusikimali mundima shenu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nongwa lingongola lindivapa nenga liva nyililili na msiwu wangu mpusu.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:30">Vasenga vavili yivalima vawopiwa lingongola mungulu</figure></para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lijuva lya kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 2:23-28, Lukasi 6:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chipindi achi Yesu, akatyangeyi mufitava fya mupunga lijuva lya kupumulila, topi vanachuli vaki vawona njala, vakanda kuketula sasa sha mpunga kunu pavadodola ngokwa shaki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu pavawonili nawula, vamuwombela Yesu, “Loli, vanachuli vaku vakugola chindu chikaniwili mumalawu kugola lijuva lya kupumulila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Musoma duhu fyagolili Dawudi pamu na vayaki pavaveghi na njala? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mweni ayingilili munyumba ya Chapanga kalya mibumunda yivikiwili litambiku lya Chapanga, mweni hata vamonga vala vajumishiwa ha kulya mibumunda yila ila vatambika weka yawu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Awu musoma duhu muchitabu cha Malawu cha Musa kila lijuva lya kupumulila vatambika vakuvifya Malawu munyumba ya Chapanga, lakini kwahela yaihola kucha vana nongwa? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Topi, nguvawombela kucha, apa kuna yaveli mkomi pitu nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kucha tungamanyili mana ya filongu afi ‘Ngudayila lusungu litambiku ha.’ Mungavahighili ha vandu vangajila nongwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mana Mwana wa mundu ndi bambu wa lijuva lya kupumulila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu munaliwoku lipombalili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 3:1-6, Lukasi 6:6-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu awukili pala kayenda munyumba ya Chapanga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaveli mundu yumu munaliwoku lipombalili. Topi, vandu vamudasha Yesu, “Finofu kumulowola mundu lijuva lya kupumulila?” Vamudashili nahawu ili vapati pa kumuhighila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavawombela, “Tudeti mundu kana meni waki kadubukila mumyowu, akotoo kumujabula kwanongwa lijuva lya kupumulila? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini mundu katauka pitu meni! Topi, tukujumishwa kugola chindu cha nyanyi lijuva lya kupumulila.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambeli kamuwombela yula mundu, “Hololi liwoku lyaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kaliholosha na lyeni liva linofu kucha lila liwoku lingi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Topi, Mafwalisayu vafuma panji vawombana, ndambu davamuwulayi Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndumindumi yashawuliwili na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu pamanyili chindu chila, kawuka pala paghaveyi. Vandu vatangalili vamukovikelili, kavalowola vatami vosi, <verse number="16" style="v"/>na avalayishili vakotoo kuvawombela vandu filongu fyaki, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Agolili wula ili fila fyadetili Chapanga kupitila mbuyi wa Chapanga Isaya fivi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Loli ayu ndumindumi wangu yindimushawulili,</para>
  <para style="q">yindimutamili na yanovilili mumoyu.</para>
  <para style="q">Dandimuviki Mfuki wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">na mweni dalanduli highilu yangu kwa vandu va milima yosi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Daghavi na malimbu ng'odu wala kuvika umatu,</para>
  <para style="q">wala lishu lyaki dalipikaniki mudeha ng'odu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lutete lufujukili daluketuliwi ha,</para>
  <para style="q">wala utambi ututuma lyosi daujimishiwi ha,</para>
  <para style="q">mbaka haki yitavali.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mweni vandu va milima yosi davamshuvilili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Besibuli</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 3:20-30, Lukasi 11:14-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pambeli vamuyeghela Yesu mundu yumu ngalimesu na yaveli ngadeta kwanongwa aveli na chinyamukela. Yesu kamulowola, kawesha kudeta na kulola. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu lijinga na kudeta, “Pamongapa ayu ndi Mwana wa Dawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lakini Mafwalisayu pavapikanishili afi, vadeta, “Mundu ayu akuvinga finyamkela kwa litawa lya Besibuli mkomi wa finyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu amanyili hoshu shawu, kavawombela, “Wutwa wowosi wuyitapulili lipinga lipinga pawulimbana, wuyikali ha. Na mbwani awu nyumba yoyosi yiitapula fipinga fipinga na kulimbana dayiwi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Payiva Lijangavandu akumuvinga Lijangavandu monga, akwilimba mweni. Topi, wutwa waki dauwoloki wuliwuli? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yumwi mukudeta kucha nguvavinga finyamkela kwa uwesu wa Besibuli, vala vanachuli va yumwi vakuwusha finyamkela kwa uwesu wa ghani? Findu fivagola vanachuli venu fikulangusha nakaka kucha yumwi muyaghamila. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini payiva nguvavinga finyamkela kwa liwovi lya Mfuki wa Chapanga, topi, mumanyi wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wufika kala kwa yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Kwahela mundu yawesha kwingila munyumba ya mundu muna liwovi na kutola findu, ngajila kumuwopa mundu ayu muna liwovi. Pamuwopili kala ndi daweshi kumupoka findu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Yoyosi yangajila kuva mwambu wangu akunimba na yoyosi yangajila kukunganya pamu na nenga akuchachasha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nongwa ayi, nguvawombela, vandu davapomiliwi sambi shosi sivagolili na kumduka kwawu kosi, lakini davapomiliwi ha sambi ya kumuduka Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kandi yadeta chilongu cha kumulimba Mwana wa mundu dapomeliwi, lakini yula yadeta chilongu cha kumulimba Mfuki Mng'alili, dapomiliwi ng'odu, wala mumlima awu wala kumulima wuyisa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Libiki na fivelekwa fyaki</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 6:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Muligoli libiki kuva linofu na fivelekwa fyaki dafivi finofu, Muligoli kuva lya wafu na fivelekwa fyaki dafivi fya wafu. Libiki likumanyika kwa fivelekwa fyaki. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yumwi vanjoka! Mukuwesha wuliwuli kudeta chilongu chinofu kunu yumwi muva va wafu? Nongwa mundu akudeta kufuma fimemili mundima yaki. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mundu mnofu akufumisha chindu chinofu kufuma mundima yaki nofu na mundu wa wafu akufumisha findu fya wafu mundima yaki wafu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Topi, nguvawombela, lijuva lya kuhighiwa vandu davayanguli kwanongwa ya filongu fingajila kujakwa fila fivadetili. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nongwa kwa chilongu chaku dawuvi goleki na kwa filongu fyaku dawuhighiwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Muhilu wa Yona</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 8:11-12, Lukasi 11:29-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pambeli vawula vamonga va Malawu na Mafwalisayu vamuwombela Yesu, “Muwula, tukudayila utulangushi mihilu yaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mweni kavayangula, “Chileli cha wafu chingajila kujumila! Mukudayila mihilu lakini damupati ng'odu chilangushilu ila chila chilangushilu cha mbuyi wa Chapanga Yona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ndambu Yona yaikalili majuva matatu mumtima ya somba mkomi, yiva nga wayikalili Mwana wa Mundu muuganga majuva matatu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vandu va Ninawi vabwituka chipindi cha kuhigha, davachihighi chileli achi. Nongwa vandu va Linawi vapomilili pavampikanishili Yona palandulili! Nguvawombela nakaka, apa pana chindu chikomi pitu Yona <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lijuva lya kuhigha, Muhumbu wa Sheba dachihighi chileli achi. Nongwa mweni yafumili mwanja mutali kayenda kupikanila chilongu cha luhunja cha Solumoni na kumbi apa kuna chikomi pitu Solumoni,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Chinyamkela mwafu, pavingiwa kwa mundu, akuyelejayeleja kucheja pasaka pahali pa kupumulila apati ha. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Na apa akwidetela, dang'uyi kayangu kufumili? Lakini pawuya payiwona kwahela, yifyaghiliwa na kunoweshwa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Akuyenda kuvatola finyamkela vamonga saba vawafu pitu mweni na vosi vakwisa kumuyingila mundu yula na ngalilu ya mundu yula yikuva ya wafu pitu dahili. topi ndi dayivi kwa vandu ava va wafu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Valongu vanakaka va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 3:31-35, Lukasi 8:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akalihela kudeta na lipinga lya vandu chipindi mawaki na valongumundu pavafikili na vawolukili panji, vakadayileyi vaywangi na Yesu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Topi, mundu yumu kamuwombela Yesu, “Mawaku na valongu vaku vava panji vakudayila kuywanga na yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamuyangula mundu yula, “Mawangu ghani? Na valongu vangu vaghani?” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Pambeli kaholola liwoku lyaki pavavasonyela vanachuli vaki, padeta, “Ava ndi vamawu vangu na valongu vangu! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nongwa yoyosi yagola fyadayila Tati wa nenga yaveli kumbindi ayu ndi muhaja wangu na mkulu wangu na mawu wangu.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha mundu yakweta</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 4:1-9, Lukasi 8:4-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva lilila, Yesu afumili mula munyumba kayenda akayikali muluwongu ya lihiva na kuwula. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lipinga likomi lya vandu vamushengitelili mbaka Yesu kayipaka muwatu, kayikala. Vandu vosi vawolukili mung'emula ya lihiva. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela filongu fitangalili kwa chilangushilu.</para>
  <para style="p">“Mupikanishi! Mundu yumu ayendili kukweta mbeyu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Paghaveyi akukweta mbeyu, simonga shaponikili mudeha na vambongu vayisa valya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Simonga shaponikili muuganga wuveli na migonguveli gonguveli pangajila uganga wutangalili. Simela kalopu, kwanongwa pavelihela uganga utangalili. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Palivalili lijuva mikigha yiyuma kwanongwa uganga waveli mudokwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Simonga shaponikilili mumisomi, misomi yikula na kuyikekeneka mihali. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Simonga shaponikilili muuganga wa nyanyi, simela na shavelikili nendu, simonga siveleka mya yimu na simonga siveleka milongu sita na simonga siveleka milongu mitatu.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Muna majeji vakupikanila apikani!”</para>
  <para style="s">Chayilata kudeta kwa chilangushilu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 4:10-12, Lukasi 8:9-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vamuyendela, vamudasha, “Nongwa liki ukudeta na vandu kwa chilangushilu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Yumwi msangiliwa kusimanya mbwepu sha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, lakini veni vasangiliwa ha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nongwa yaveli na chindu akugayiliwa na kuyongeshiwa, Lakini yula yangajila chindu, hata chila chidokwa chavelili nachu na cheni chikupokiwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nongwa ngudeta nawu kwa chilangushilu, kwanongwa vakulembesha lakini vakulola ha, vakupikanisha lakini vakupikana ha, wala vakumanya ha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaveni fiva fila fyadetili Mbuyi Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Kupikana damupikani, lakini mumanyi ha.</para>
  <para style="q">Kusepa damusepi lakini damuloli ha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nongwa luhala lwa vandu ava lupufika,</para>
  <para style="q">vadiva majeji vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">Vagunga kwa mesu vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">pamonga vangalolili kwa mesu vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">na vangapikanishili kwa majeji vawu,</para>
  <para style="q">na vangamanyili kwa luhala lwawu,</para>
  <para style="q">na veni vangaghalambukili, pavadeta Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q">na nenga ningavalowulili.’ ”</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta kandi, “Ngiba yumwi! Nongwa mesu venu vakulola na majeji venu vakupikana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, Vambuyi va Chapanga na vandu goleki vatangalili vadayilili nendu kufiwona fila fimufiwona yumwi na vafiwona ha na kufipikana fila fimufipikana yumwi na vafipikana ha.</para>
  <para style="s">Himulilu ya chilangushilu cha yakweta</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 4:13-20, Lukasi 8:11-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Topi yumwi muyiwuli kwa chilangushilu cha mkweta. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yoyosi yapikana chilongu cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ngajila kumanya, akuva kucha sila mbeyu siponikili mudeha, Yula mwafu akwisa na kusitola sila sikwetiwili mumoyu waki. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mbeyu yila yikwetilwi mumigonguveli ndi chilangushilu cha mundu yapikanisha chilongu achi na kuchipokela kwa cheleli. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini akuchikamula ha na mikigha yaki, yikuyendilela kukula nendu ha. Pambeli pawubwituka kugobuleka kwanongwa ya chilongu achi, akulepisiwa kalopu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yila mbeyu yiponikili pamibiki ya misomi, ndi chilangushilu cha mundu yapikanila chilongu, lakini chipwembwi cha mlimawu na kufwamuka kwa mali likuchikekeneka chilongu achi na mweni akulela ha fivelekwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yila mbeyu yikwetiwili muuganga mnofu ndi chilangushilu cha mundu yapikanila chilongu cha Chapanga na kuchimanya na mweni akulela fivelekwa, Yumu mya, wingi milongu sita na wingi kandi milongu mitatu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha mityendya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela vandu chilangushilu chingi, “Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuyifwana nga naha, mundu yakwetili mbeyu nofu muchitava chaki. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pamihi yimu vandu pavaveli mung'onju chimudwama yumu ayisili katulila mityendya mumpunga, pambeli awukili. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi, muhali pawukulili na kukanda kuyalula na mityendya wuwula yiwoneka. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vandumindumi va yula muna chitava vamuyendela, vamuwombela, Bambu, yuwi wakwetili mbeyu nofu muchitava chaku, ponopa mityendya yifuma koti? <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mweni kavayangula, ‘Chimudwama ndi yagolili nahawu,’ Topi, vandumindumi vaki vamudasha, wuli, ukudayila tuyendi tukatupuli mityendya? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yula munachitava kavayangula, ng'odu, mukotoo kugola nahawu, pamongapa pamutupula mityendya mukuwesha kutupula pamu na mupunga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Muyileki yikuli pamu mbaka chipindi cha kubena, chipindi achi dandivawombeli vala yivabena. Mukungashi tanila mityendya mukawopi milundumilundu ya kunyanya motu, lakini mupunga mukunganyi mukauviki mulusanja lwangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela vandu chilangushilu chingi, “Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuyifwana ngimu mbeyu dokwa nendu yatolili mundu yumu, kayikomulela muchitava chaki. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yeni dokwa pitu mbeyu shonda, lakini payimela likuva libiki likomi pitu mibiki yosi, hata vambongu vakwisa na kujenga miyumba yawu mumitafyi yaki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha simika</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 13:20-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela chilangushilu chingi, “Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wukwifwana na simika yatolili mawu yumu, kayihasha na ukova fitandavala fivili na litingaja, ukova wosi kawupundila mumula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adetili kwa chilangushilu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 4:33-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu avawombilili mipinga ya vandu fyosi afi kwa chilangushilu, kavawombela chindu chimu ngajila chilangushilu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Agolili naha ili chilongu chivadetili vambuyi va Chapanga chivi.</para>
  <para style="q">“Dadeti nawu kwa filangushilu,</para>
  <para style="q">Dandivafisulili fifisikili kufumila ulumbi wa mlimawu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuhimulila chilangushilu cha mityendya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavayitawula vala vandu, kayingila munyumba. Vanachuli vaki vamuyendela, vamuwombela, “Tuwombeli unofu chila chilangushilu cha mityendya mufitava.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yakweta sila mbeyu nofu ndi Mwana wa Mundu, <verse number="38" style="v"/>chila chitava ndi mlimawu. Sila mbeyu nofu ndi vandu vala yivavelili muwutwa waki. Lakini yila mityendya ndi vala vandu va yula Mwafu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na chimundwama yapandili yila mityendya ndi Lijangavandu. Fivelekwa ndi mwishu wa mlima na vabeni ndi vamakungu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ngimu wula mityendya yikukungiwa na kunyanywa motu, ndi dayivi chipindi cha lijuva lya mwishu mlimawu, <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwana wa mundu davalayili makungu vaki vavawushi kufuma muwutwa waki vala vosi yivavagola vandu vagoli sambi na vosi yivagolili findu fya wafu, <verse number="42" style="v"/>na kuvayasila mutanuli lya motu na aku davalili na kugelujula minu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pambeli vala goleki davang'ali kucha lijuva muwutwa wa Tati wawu. Muna majeji apikani!</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha lusanja luyifisili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wukwifwana ngimu naha, mundu yumu ayiwonili sanja yiifisili muchitava. Asekilili munu mbaka kayenda kuhemesha fyosi fyaveli nafyu, kachihemela chitava chila.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha chumang'andu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Kandi, wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuyifwana ngimu naha, mchulusi yumu yasaka lulu nofu, <verse number="46" style="v"/>na payipatili lulu yimu ya mbiya ngomi, kayenda kawula fyosi fyaveli nafyu kahemela lulu yila.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha lwafu na somba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Kandi, wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuyifwana ngimu naha, lwafu luwutegha mulweni na kuwomesha vasomba va kila ndambu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Palumemili, vandu valukweghilili kumuhanga, vayikala, vavashawula vasomba vanofu na kuvavika mufitandavala fyawu na vasomba vangajila kuvadayila vavayasa. <verse number="49" style="v"/>topi ndi dayivi mwishu wa mlima, Makungu wa Chapanga davabwitukili, davalekanishi vandu vawafu na vandu goleki, <verse number="50" style="v"/>na kuvayasa ava vawafu mutanuli lya motu. Aku davalili na kugelujula minu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lusanja lwa shonu na lukulukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha, “Mupikana findu fyosi afi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamuyangula, “Yina.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Mweni kavawombela, “Topi, kila muwula va Malawu yaveli mwanachuli wa wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga akwifwana na muna nyumba yatola mulusanja lwaki findu fya shonu na fikulukulu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akukaniwa aku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 6:1-6, Lukasi 4:16-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu pamalilili kudeta filangushilu afi, awukili, <verse number="54" style="v"/>kawuya kuchijiji chaki. Aku avelili akuvawula vandu munyumba ya Chapanga vala vampikanishili vajinga, vayidashili, “Ayu kapata koti luhunja nga alu? Na kapata koti liwovi lya kugola mihilu nga ayi? <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ayu mwana wa selimala yula nda? Mamundu Maliya na valongu vaki Yakobi na Yosefu na Simoni na Yuda ng'odu? <verse number="56" style="v"/>Na vaghanja vaki vosi vakwikala bahapa pamu na yufwi nda? Kapata koti fyosi afi?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Topi, vava na njelangu vamjumila ha.</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini Yesu kavawombela, “Mbuyi akupata ndundamilu pawuhenja, ila akupota kutundamiliwa pakayaki na kwa valongu vaki!” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Kwanongwa aku vajumilili ng'odu agolili mihilu yitangalili ha.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kusova kwa Yohani mbatisha</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 6:14-29, Lukasi 9:7-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chipindi chila Helodi mtavala wa Galilaya, apikanishili milandu ya Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Topi, kavawombela Vandumindumi vaki, “Nakaka ayu ndi Yohani mbatisha, kashukuka kufuma kumambi, Kwa nongwa akuwesha kugola mihilu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Helodi ndi alayishili kukamuliwa kwa Yohani mbatisha na kuwopiwa muchijaka kwanongwa ya Helodiya, mdala wa Filipu mkulumundu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha kwa chipindi aveli kamuwombela Helodi, “Nyanyi ha yuwi kumuheta Helodiya!” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Helodi akadayileyi kumuwulagha Yohani lakini vatilili vandu kwanongwa Yohani aveli mbuyi wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mulihungu lya ngumbungumbu ya kuwoneka kwa Helodi, kamwali wa Helodiya afinili pawulongolu ya vahenja. Helodi apekesukili, <verse number="7" style="v"/>hata kayilapila kwa kamwali waki, “Ngwilapa kucha dangugayili chindu chochosi chiwuluva!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mweni kunu pajongishewa na mamundu, kaluva, “Unyimbi bahapa muluselu mutwi wa Yohani mbatisha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mutwa ang'ong'utekili, lakini kwanongwa amujangili pawulongolu ya vahenja, kavalayisha vamupi chindu chaluvili. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi, Helodi kalayila vayeghi mutwi wa Yohani mbatisha kufuma muchijaka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mutwi waki uyeghiwa muluselu, vamupa yula kamwali na mweni kamuyeghela mamundu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vanachuli va Yohani vayisa vachitola chikongu chaki, vachisika. Pambeli vayenda kumuwombela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avagayilili chilivi valya vandu nendu ya elufu muhanu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 6:30-44, Lukasi 9:10-17, Yohani 6:1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu papikanishili milandu ayi, awukili mahali pala kwa watu kayenda mahali pachifisu. Lakini vandu vapatili milandu ayi, vamukovikelili kwa mawulu kufuma kumbwani. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Topi, pafikili kuluwongu kaliwona lipinga likomi lya vandu, kavawonela lusungu, kavalowola vatami vawu,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Payifikili lumihi, vanachuli vaki vamuyendela vamuwombela, “Apa paweka na ngesha yikupela. Topi, wuvaleki vandu ava ili vayendi kufijiji vakayihemileli filivi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mukotoo kuvaleka vayendi, yumwi muvapi filivi valiyi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini veni vamuwombela, “Tuva na mibumunda muhanu na vasomba vavili hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Munyegheli apa.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kavawombela vandu vayikali pasi mumidasi. Pambeli Yesu kayitola yila mibumunda muhanu na vala vasomba vavili, kayinula mesu kalola kumbindi kwa Chapanga kafinemela, pambeli kayimetula yila mibumunda, kavapa vanachuli vaki na veni vavapa vandu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vandu vosi valya, vayikuta. Pambeli vanachuli vakungasha fisighalili, vamemesha vitandavala lilongu na fivili. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tolitoli ya valulumi yivalili vaveli alufu muhanu ngajila kuvalanga vamawu na vana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyendayenda mumbindi ya bahali</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 6:45-52, Yohani 6:15-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tepu, Yesu kavawombela vanachuli vaki vayipaki muwatu, valongoli kumwambu ya lihiva chipindi mweni akwitawula vandu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pavayitawulili kala vandu kakwela kuchidunda weka yaki kudadava. Payiveyi palumihi, mweni aveli aku weka yaki, <verse number="24" style="v"/>na chipindi achi wula watu wuvayipakilili vala vanachuli vaki waveli kutali mulihiva, lakini vagobulikili kwanongwa lingukumbi lyaveli likuwutova watu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pamihi paliveyi samba kuchia, Yesu avayendilili vanachuli payendayenda mumbindi ya machi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki pavamuwonili payendayenda mumbindi ya machi vayipwelishili. Vadetili, “Chishuka!” Vawuta kwa lyogha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tepu, Yesu avawombilili, “Msiki, ndiva nenga, mukotoo kutila!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petili kamuwombela, “Bambu, leki yuwi nakaka, ung'ombeli nyendinyendi mumbindi ya machi nyisi kwa yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Topi wisi.” Topi, Petili kajabuka kufuma mula muwatu, kayendayenda mumbindi ya machi, kamuyendela Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini pawonili lingukumbi lila, atilili, kakanda kumilwa, kalila kwa lishu, “Bambu, unowoli!” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu kawolosha liwoku lyaki, kamukamula na kumuwombela, “Yuwi muna ujumilwa mdokwa! Kwa nongwa liki wayipwelishili?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pambeli vosi vayipaka muwatu na lingukumbi lisika. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vavelili muwatu vafiwonili, vamtundamilili, “Nakaka ayu mwana wa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vatami aku Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 6:35-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Vajabukili lihiva vafika mlima wa Genesaleti. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vandu va aku pavamanyili Yesu akwisa, topi vavakungulili vatami mumlima wosi vavayegha kwa Yesu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Vamuluva avajumishi vagufyi luviniku lwa yingwa yaki hela. Na vosi yivamugufyili vanana.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chishovi cha vavaha</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 7:1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Mafwalisayu vamu na vawula va Malawu vafumili Yelusalemu, vamuyendela Yesu, vamudasha, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Kwanongwa liki vanachuli vakukombikesha ng'odu fila tufipokilili kwa vavaha vetu? Vakunava kukandila mawoku ngimu ya chishovi chetu ha pavadayila kulya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula “Ngimu yumwi mukukombikesha ng'odu Malawu va Chapanga ila mukudayila ng'ulilu yenu? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mweni Chapanga awombili, wuvatundamili Tati waku na mawu waku, ‘Na yamujowola tati mundu awu mamundu dawulayiwi.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini yumwi mukuwula kucha mundu paghava na chindu chila chingaweshili kumtanga tati mundu awu mamundu, lakini yidetiwa, ‘chindu achi chitawuliwa kwa Chapanga,’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>yumwi mukumtundamila kandi ha tati mundu, ndi nahawu mukusalawu Malawu va Chapanga kwa kukovikela ng'ulilu yenu mwaveni. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yumwi vafyangu! Isaya atungili maha milandu ya yumwi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Chapanga akudeta, vandu ava vakujuma nenga kwa mulomu hela,</para>
  <para style="q">lakini mundima shawu vava kutali na nenga,</para>
  <para style="q">lakini ngunda shawu siva kutali na nenga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kundundamila kwawu kuna mana ng'odu,</para>
  <para style="q">nongwa vakuwula malayishu va vandu hela!”</para>
  <para style="s">Findu fimuvika mundu wafu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 7:14-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu alikemili lipinga lya vandu limwisili, kavawombela, “Mupikanishi na mumanyi! <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chindu chimutaya mundu wafu chila chimwingila mugati ha, ila chila chimufuma. Achi ndi chimutaya mundu wafu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pambeli vanachuli vamuyendela, vamuwombela, “Yuwi kumanya chivaluma Mafwalisayu mundima shawu pavapikanishili filongu fiwuwombili?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini mweni kavayangula, “Muhali wungajila kukwetiwa na Tati wa wangu yaveli kumbindi dawutupuliwi,” <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Mukotoo kuvayipwelesha veni! Vangalimesu mesu, fiwongosi va vangalimesu na ngalimesu pamulongosha ngalimesu monga, vosi vavili vakudubukila mumyowu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Petili kadeta, “Tuwombeli mana ya chilangushilu achi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yumwi muvahela luhunja pitu vengi? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mumanya ng'odu? Kila chiyingila mugati chikuyenda mumunda na pambeli chikufumishwa pawuyenda kudasi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lakini findu fifuma mumlomu fikufuma mundima na afi ndi fikumutaya mundu wafu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nongwa kundima kukufuma hoshu sha wafu simugola awulayi na agoli uwoni na upeji na wifi na utovileli wa ufyangu na kuvajowola vengi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Afi ndi fimutaya mundu wafu. Lakini kulya ngajila kunava mawoku kukumtaya mundu wafu ha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ujumilwa wa mawu yumu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 7:24-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu awukili pala kayenda kwikala kumukova wuveli pabehi ya Tilu na Sidoni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Topi, mawu yumu Mkanani wa mlima wula amwisilili, palila kwa lishu, “Bambu, mwana wa Dawudi ung'oneli lusungu, kamwali wangu akufwashiwa na chinyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamuyangula chindu ha. Topi, vanachuli vaki vamuyendela, vamuwombela, “Mumuwombeli ayendi kwanongwa akutukovikela kunu akutuvikila chowu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Nayishiwa kwa vafungami va nyumba ya Isilaeli yivayaghamilili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Topi, yula mawu kayisa kamugondamila, kadeta, “Bambu, wundangi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Finofu ha kutola filivi fya vana na kuvayasila vagalu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mawu ayu kayangula, “Nakaka, Bambu, lakini hata galu akulya fyaponishili Bambu mundu kufuma pamesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Mawu, ujumilwa waku mkomi, topi, yigoleki ngimu wudayila.” Yula kamwali waki kanana chipindi chichila chila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vandu vatangalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu awukili pala kayenda kuluwongu ya lihiva Galilaya, kakwela kuchidunda, kayikala. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vamwisila, vavayegha vandevindevi na vangalimesu na fikwavakwava na vangadeta na vamonga vatangalili yivaveli vatami, vavavika pamawulu va Yesu na mweni kavalowola. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lipinga lila lya vandu vajingili nendu pavawonili ngadeta akudeta na vapombalili vanana na vandevindevi vakuyendayenda na vangalimesu mesu vakulola, vandu vamujuma Chapanga wa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvapa filivi vandu elufu mchechi</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 8:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Topi Yesu avakemili vanachuli vaki, kadeta, “Nguvawonela lusungu vandu ava kwanongwa vayikala na nenga kwa majuva matatu, ponopa vavahela filivi. Ngudayila ha kwivatawula na kuvaleka na njala vakuwesha kushunga mudeha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vamdashili, “Tuva pachivala, datupati koti filivi fya kukwila lipinga lyosi ali?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha, “Muvanayu mibumunda miningi?” Vamuyangula, “Saba na fisomba fidokwa.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu kaliwombela lipinga lya vandu liyikali pasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pambeli kayitola yila mibumunda saba na fila fisomba, kamulumba Chapanga, kafidumula, kavapa vanachuli vaki na veni vavavaghashila vandu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vosi valya, vayikuta, pambeli vakungasha fisighalili, vamemesha fitandavala saba. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ava valili vaveli valulumi elufu mchechi ngajila kuvalanga vadadala na vana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavayitawula vandu, kayipaka watu kayenda mkowa wa Magadani.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Vandu vakudayila mihilu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 8:11-13, Lukasi 12:54-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu na Masadukayu vamuyendilili Yesu, ili kumuyesha, vamuluva avalangushi mihilu kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavayangula, “Payifika lumihi yumwi mukudeta, ‘Dakuchiyi finofu kwanongwa lulanga luva lukeli!’ <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na putiputi pamuwona mafundi pii mukudeta nalelu dakuvi na ndonya, nongwa lulanga lukeli na mafundi vakwila! Topi, yumwi mwimanya munu kulola chipindi kwa kulola lulanga, lakini kumanya chilangushilu cha chipindi achi mumanya ha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Chileli achi cha wafu chingajila kumujumila Chapanga! Chikudayila chilangushilu, lakini chikupata chilangushilu chochosi ha, ili chilangushilu chila cha Yona.”</para>
  <para style="p">Topi, kavaleka, mweni kawuka.</para>
  <para style="s">Simika ya Mafwalisayu na Masadukayu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 8:14-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki pavajabukili kala mwambu monga wa lihiva, kumbi vayivasuwa kutola mibumunda. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mwikali mesu na muyivavali na simika ya Mafwalisayu na Masadukayu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini veni vaveli vakwiwombela, “Akudeta naha kwanongwa tutola ng'odu mibumunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kafimanya fivayihola, kavawombela, “Yumwi vandu yimuveli na ujumilwa mdokwa! Mbona mukuwombana kwilata mibumunda yimwilekili? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mkalihela kumanya? Mukukumbuka duhu, pandiyiketulili yila mibumunda muhanu na kwanongwa ya vala vandu alufu muhanu? Mwamemishili fitandavala finingi fya mibumunda yisighalili? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Awu yila mibumunda saba yivagayiliwi vala vandu alufu mchechi, mwakungili fitandavala finingi fya mibumunda yisighalili? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wuli mbona yumwi mukumanya ng'odu kucha ngadeteyi kwilata mibumunda ng'odu? Mwivavali na simika ya Mafwalisayu na Masadukayu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apa vanachuli vamanya kucha avawombilili vayivavali na simika ya mibumunda ha, ila na ngulilu sha Mafwalisayu na Masadukayu.</para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumjumila kucha Yesu mwana wa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 8:27-30, Lukasi 9:18-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu pafikili mwambu wa Kayisalia Filipu, avadashili vanachuli vaki, “Vandu vakudeta kucha Mwana wa Mundu ndi ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vamuyangula, “Vamonga vakudeta yuwi Yohani mbatisha, vamonga vakudeta yuwi Eliya na vamonga vakudeta yuwi Yelimiya awu yumu wa vambuyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha, “Na yumwi mukudeta nenga ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Simoni Petili kayangula, “Yuwi kuva Kilistu Mukombola Mwana wa Chapanga yaveli munofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta, ngiba yuwi Simoni mwana wa Yona, kwanongwa kwahela mundu yoyosi yakugubutulili chilongu achi ila Tati wangu yaveli kumbindi, <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na nenga ngukuwombela: Yuwi ndi Petili na paligonguveli ali dajengi lipinga lya vandu limjumilili Kilistu lyangu, wala liwovi lya kusova dalilemwi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Dandikupi chifuwulilu cha Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, Chindu dawuchitatili mumlima awu dachitatiwi wuwowu kwa Chapanga na chila dawuchifuwulili mumlima awu, dachifuwuliwi wuwowu kwa Chapanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pambeli kavakayika vanachuli vaki vakotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyonda kucha mweni ndi Kilistu Mukombola.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta kwilata gobuleku na njifwa yaki</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 8:31-38, Maliku 9:1, Lukasi 9:22-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kukandila chipindi chila Yesu akandili kuvawombela vanachuli vaki ngajila chifisu, “Danyendi Yelusalemu na aku vavaha na vatambika na vakomi na vawula va Malawu davagoboli nendu. Davang'ulayi lakini lijuva lya tatu dashukushiwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Petili papikanishili nawula kamukwegha Yesu pambali, kakanda kumulakalila, Kotoo kudeta nahawu Bambu! Chilongu achi dachikupati ng'odu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kaghalambuka, kamuwombela Petili, “Wuki pawulongolu yangu Lijangavandu! Yuwi ukungingama nenga. Fiwuyihola fya Chapanga ha, fya mundu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela vanachuli vaki, “Mundu yoyonda padayila kuva ndundami wangu, ayilemi mweni, atoli lupingika lwaki, angovikeli. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nongwa mundu yadayila kuulowola unofu vaki mweni, dawuyaghamishi, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lakini mundu yawuyaghamisha unofu vaki kwanongwa ya nenga dawupati. Ngiba liki mundu paupata unaiza wosi wa mlima awu kunu kauyaghamisha unofu vaki? Awu mundu datoli chindu liki chivi badili ya unofu vaki? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nongwa mwana wa mundu dayisi muukomi wa Tati waki pamu na makungu waki na apa ndi davahombi kila mundu ngimu wagolili. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, kuvaveli vamonga bahapa davasovi ha mbaka vamuwoni tanila Mwana wa Mundu payisa muwutwa waki.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu aghalambukili wushu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 9:2-13, Lukasi 9:28-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pavapitili majuva sita, Yesu kavatola Petili na Yakobi na Yohani mlongu mundu, kayenda nawu weka yawu kumbindi kuchidunda chitali. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Aku Yesu aghalambukili wushu pawulongolu yawu, wushu waki wung'ala kucha lijuva na yingwa shaki siva ngeli kucha lulanga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pambeli vandundami ava vatatu vavawona Musa na Eliya vabwituka, vakuywanga na Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi, Petili kamuwombela Yesu, “Bambu, nyanyi yufwi twikali bahapa! Pawudayila apa dajengi fibudi fitatu, chimu chaku na chimu cha Musa na chimu cha Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Paghaveyi akali akudeta afi, lifundi ling'alili livagubika na lishu lipikanika kufuma mulifundi lila, “Ayu ndi Mwana wangu yindimtamili, mayiliwa na mweni. Mumpikanishi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki pavapikanishili naha vawa wifuma, vatila nendu, <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kavayisila na kavagufya, kadeta, “Muwoloki, mukotoo kutila!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pavalolili kumbindi vamuwona mundu ha, ila Yesu weka hela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi, pavaveghi vakusunuka chidunda, Yesu kavakayika, “Mkotoo kumuwombela mundu findu yimufiwonili mbaka Mwana wa mundu pashukushiwa kufuma munjifwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pambeli vanachuli vamudasha, “Mbona vawula va Malawu vakudeta mbaka Eliya ayisi tanila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Nakaka, Eliya dayisi kutanda findu fyosi, <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini nguvawombela, Eliya kayisa kala lakini veni vamumanyili ha, ila vamugolilili kucha wuvadayilili. Wuwowu Mwana wa Mundu dateshiwi mumawoku vawu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi vala vanachuli vamanya kucha aveli akuvawombela Yohani mbatisha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vana yivavelili na chinyamkela.</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 9:14-29, Lukasi 9:37-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pavalifikilili kandi lila lipinga lya vandu, mundu yumu amuyendilili Yesu, kamutundamila, <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Kadeta, Bambu muwoneli lusungu mwana wangu kana chisilika, akugobuleka munu, myanja yitangalili akuwila mumotu na mumachi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngamuyeghili kwa vanachuli vaku lakini vaweshili ha kumulowola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Yumwi chileli chingajila ujumilwa, chiyaghamili! Dandiyikali na yumwi mbaka ndili? Dandivawunishili yumwi mbaka ndili? Mumuyeghi apa mwana ayu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu kamulakalila yula chinyamkela na mweni kamufuma yula mwana, mwanja wuwula wula kanana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pambeli vanachuli vamuyendela Yesu kwa chifisu, vamudasha, “Kwanongwa liki yufwi tulemwa kumuwusha yula chinyamkela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Nongwa ya ujumilwa wenu mdokwa. Nguvawombela nakaka, pamuva na ujumilwa hela, wuvi mdokwa hata kucha mbeyu ya likuyu, mukuwesha kuchiwombela chidunda achi, Wuki apa yendi pala, cheni dachiyendi. Kwahela chindu chingajila yumwi kuwesha.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lakini mayandiku vamonga vayandika, “Finyamkela fya ndambu ayi fikuwuka kwa njila ayi ha, ila kwa kudadava na kwikaja kulya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta kandi milandu ya njifwa na kushukuka kwa mweni</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 9:30-32, Lukasi 9:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pavaveghi pamu aku Galilaya, Yesu avawombilili, “Mwana wa mundu datawuliwi mumawoku va vandu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Davamuwulayi, lakini lijuva lya tatu kukandila pasovili, dashukushiwi.” Vanachuli vang'ong'oteka munu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhomba saka ya nyumba ya kudadavila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pavafikili Kapelinaumu vandu yivakunganya kodi ya Nyumba ya kudadavila vamuyendilili Petili, vamudasha, muwula wenu akuhombaya kodi ya Nyumba ya kudadavila?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Petili kayangula, “Yina, akuhomba.” Topi, Petili payingilili munyumba, hata akali hela kudeta chilongu chochosi, Yesu kamudasha, Simoni, “Yuwi ukuwona wuliwuli? Vatwa va mlimawu vakukunga ushulu awu kodi kufuma kwa vaghani! Kufuma kwa vanamlima awu kwa vahenja?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Petili kayangula, “Kufuma kwa vahenja, Yesu kavawombela mani naha vanamlima yikuvayilata ha.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini tukotoo kuvavifya, yendi kulihiva kalopoli, Toli somba yatalili kuwomela, umutumbuli, mugati ukusiwona mbiya sha saka. Toli ukahombi kwanongwa ya nenga na yuwi.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ghani yaveli mkomi?</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 9:33-37, Lukasi 9:46-48</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chipindi chila vanachuli vamuyendilili Yesu, vamudasha, “Ghani yaveli mkomi nendu muwutwa wakumbindi kwa Chapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kamukema mwana yumu, kamuwolosha pagati yawu, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pambeli kadeta, “Nguvawombela nakaka pamupota kughalambuka kuva kucha vana, damwingili ng'odu muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yoyosi yangajila kwikwisha kucha mwana ayu, ayu ndi yaveli mkomi muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mundu yamulibushila mwana yumu kucha ayu kwa litawa lyangu, akumbokela nenga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ngingamu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 9:42-48, Lukasi 17:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Lakini mundu damuvifyi yumu wa ava vadokwa yivajumilili nenga, yingaveli ngiba awopiwi mungulu ligonguveli lya kushaghila na kudibashiwa mumachi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngiba mlima kwanongwa ya ngingamu sivagufya vatangalili. Ngingamu asi dasifumbuki lakini ngiba mundu yula dafigoli figoleki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Kucha liwoku awu liwuli lyaku palikuvifya wulidumuli na wuliyasi kutali nayuwi. Ngiba kwa yuwi kwingila muunofu wa jola ngajila liwoku awu liwulu, pitu kudangiwa mulifumbika pawuva na mawoku mavili na mawulu vaku mavili. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lisu lyaku palikuvifya, likolopoli na kulidangila kutali na yuwi. Ngiba kwingila muunofu pawuva nandoju, pitu kudangiwa mumotu wa lifumbika pawuva na mesu vosi mavili.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha fungami yayaghamilili</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 15:3-7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Mwivavali! Mukotoo kumubedala hata yumu wa ava wadokwa. Nguvawombela, Makungu vawu aku kwa Chapanga majuva vosi vava pawulongolu pa Tati wangu yaveli kumbindi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mana Mwana wa Mundu ayisili kuchilowola chiyaghamilili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Mukuwona wuliwuli? Mundu paghava na vafungami mya, pamuyaghamisha yumu, akugola wuliwuli? Akuvaleka vala milongu tisa na tisa kuchidunda, akuyenda kumusaka yula yayaghamilili. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pamuwona, nguvawombela nakaka, akumunemilela yula pitu hata vala milongu tisa na tisa vangajila kuyaghamila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wuwowu, Tati wenu yaveli kumbindi, akudayila ng'odu hata yumu wa ava vadokwa vayaghamili.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupomela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mlongu waku pakuvifya, muyendi mukajovi pamuva weka yenu Pakupikana dawuvi kumupata mulongu waku. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pakupikana ng'odu, umtoli mundu yumu awu vavili pamu na yuwi ili hoshu sha vatovilela vavili awu vatatu chilongu chosi chihighiwi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pavapikana ng'odu ava, uliwombeli lipinga lya vandu limjumilili Kilistu, kucha palipikana ng'odu lipinga lya vandu limjumilili Chapanga, Topi, yavavika yumwi kucha vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga na vasumula mbiya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kutatiwa na kufuwuliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, chila damuchitati mumlima wuwula wula dachitatiwi kumbindi kwa Chapanga na chimuchifuwula pamulima wuwula wula dachifuwuliwi kwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Kandi nguvawombela vavili pavajumila apa pamlimawu kwilata chindu chochosi cha kuluva, Tati wangu wa kumbindi davagoleli chindu achi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa poposi pala pavayikungasha vavili awu vatatu kwa litawa lyangu, nenga ndiva pamu na veni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha ndundami yangajila kupomela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pambeli Petili kamuyendela Yesu kamudasha, “Bambu mlongu wangu pamifya ndimupomeli kaningi? Myanja saba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Ngudeta myanja saba hela ha, ila milongu saba myanja milongu saba. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ndi nongwa wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wukwifwana na mutwa yumu yadayileyi tolitoli ya Vandumindumi vaki. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pakandili kukawula, vamuyeghela mundu yumu yaveli na nongwa ya mbiya milongu alufu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mundoyu aveli kavahela cha kuhomba, Ponopa Bambu mundu kalayisha vamuhemeshi mweni na mdalamundu na vana na fyosi fyaveli nafyu, akahombi nongwa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi, ayu ndumindumi katundama pawulongolu yaki, kadeta, ‘Umeti danguhombi nongwa yaku yosi.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yula Bambu kamuwonela lusungu, kampomela nongwa yila, kamuleka ayendi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Lakini ndumindumi yula awukili, kamuwona yumu wa ndumindumi mumonga yaveli na nongwa yaki ya mbiya mya. Kamukamula kamukama pangulu kunu padeta, ‘Hombi mbiya shangu!’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yula ndumindumi monga katundama, kamuluva, ‘Umeti danguhombi.’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini mweni kalema, ila kamuwopa muchijaka mbaka pahomba yila nongwa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Topi, vandumindumi vamonga pavawonili chilongu achi vang'ong'oteka munu, vayenda kumuwombela Bambu wawu chilongu chila chibwitukili. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Topi, yula Bambu kamukema yula ndumindumi kamuwombela, yuwi ndumindumi mwafu munu! Yuwi wanuvili na nenga ngupomela nongwa yaku yosi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na yuwi wungamuwonilili lusungu kucha nenga wungugolilili kwa ndumindumi muyaku? <verse number="34" style="v"/>Topi Bambu yula akalalili munu, kamufumisha yula ndumindumi alatuliwi mbaka pahomba nongwa yosi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kamalilila kwa kudeta, “Na Tati wangu yaveli kumbindi davagoleli nahawu kucha mundu pamupomela ng'odu mlongu mundu kwa moyu waki wosi.”</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta milandu ya kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 10:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu akamalili kudeta filongu fila, kawuka Galilaya, kayenda Yudeya kumwambu ya lweni Yoludani. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vamukovikela, mweni kavalowola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vamu vamwisilili, vamudasha kwa kumushengeta, “Wuli, malawu vetu vakujumisha mlumi kumleka mdala mundu kwanongwa yoyosi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Wuli, musoma duhu Mumayandiku Vang'alili, kucha pakwandi Chapanga amulumbili mundu mlumi na mdala, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Chapanga adetili, ‘Kwa nongwa ayi mlulumi damuleki Tati waki na mawaki davayibavi na mdala mundu na veni davavi yumu?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ponopa, veni vavili kandi ha ila mundu yumu. Topi chavikili pamu Chapanga, mundu akotoo kuchilekanisha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini Mafwalisayu vamudasha, “Nongwa liki Musa atulayishili kumleka mdala mbaka yiyandikiwi talaka ndi alekiwi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Musa avajumishili kuvaleka vadala venu nongwa ndima shenu sidindala. Lakini yavelili nahawu ha Chapanga palumbeyi mlima. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi, nguvawombela, mundu yamleka mdala mundu na kumuheta wingi akali akagola uwoni, ila paamleka kwanongwa ya uwoni wa mdala yula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vamuwombela, “Kucha milandu ya mlumi na mdala yiva naha, ngiba kuleka kuheta.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Vosi ha yivawesha kupokela chilongu achi, ila vala hela yavatangili Chapanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nongwa kuna nongwa simu simugola mundu aleki kuheta, vamonga kwanongwa vawoneka nahawu na vamonga kwanongwa vagoliwa nahawu na vandu na vamonga vawona ngiba vakotoo kuheta kwanongwa ya wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Yawesha kupokela ng'ulilu ayi apokeli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvanemela vana vadokwa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 10:13-16, Lukasi 18:15-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambeli vandu vamuyeghela Yesu vana vadokwa avavikili mawoku na kuvadadavila kwa Chapanga. Lakini vanachuli vavalakalila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta, “Muvaleki vana ava vayisi kwa nenga, mukotoo kuvakana nongwa Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ndi wa vandu yivaveli kucha vana ava.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi, kavavikila mawoku, pambeli kawuka.</para>
  <para style="s">Chijana naisa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 10:17-31, Lukasi 18:18-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mundu yumu ayisili kwa Yesu, kamudasha, “Muwula, goli chindu liki chinofu ili ndiwupati unofu wa jola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Mbona ukudasha milandu ya nyanyi? Kuna yumu hela yaveli msangi. Pawudayila kwingila muunofu wa jola, koli Malawu va Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yula mundu kamudasha, malawu voti?</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kadeta, “Kotoo kuwulagha, kotoo kugola uwoni, kotoo kuhija na kotoo kutovilela ufyangu, <verse number="19" style="v"/>vapikanishi tati waku na mawu waku na umutami mjofi mwawu ngimu witama umweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yula chijana kamuwombela, “Fyosi afi ndifikola: chamunu goli liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Leki ukudayila kuva nyanyi, yendi kawuli mali shaku, mbiya dawusipati uvapi vagaju na yuwi dawuvi na lusanja kwa Chapanga pambeli wisi ungovikeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yula chijana papikanishili afi, kawuka kunu pang'ong'oteka, nongwa aveli mlundamali.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kavawombela vanachuli vaki, “Nakaka nguvawombela, yidindala munu kwa mulundamali kwingila Muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kandi nguvawombela, yipusuka nendu kwa ndembu kwingila muchilanga cha sasiya, pitu mulundamali kwingila muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vala vanachuli pavapikanishili nawula vajinga munu, vamudasha, “Leki yiva nahawu, ghani dalowoki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kavalola, kadeta, “kwa mundu fidindala, lakini kwa Chapanga findu fyosi fipusuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli Petili kadeta, “Yufwi tufileka fyosi tukukovikela, datupati liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nguvawombela nakaka mwana wa mundu payikala muchigoda cha wutwa wa muukomi, yumwi lilongu na vavili yimungovikela damwikali mufigoda pamuvahigha makabila lilongu na vavili va Isilaeli. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na mundu yayilekili nyumba, mlongu awu muhaja, tati awu mawu, vana awu fitava kwanongwa ya nenga, dapokeli myanja mya na nendu, dapati na unofu wa jola. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lakini yivaveli vakwaa davavi kumbeli na yivavelili kumbeli davavi vakwaa.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Vagolafichuku muchitava cha misabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wifwana nga mundu yumu munachitava cha misabibu, yavelili kafuma pamalavila puti kuvavika vagolafichuku va muchitava chaki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Awombanili nawu kuvahomba mbiya ijala ya lijuva limu, pambeli kavayegha muchitava chaki cha misabibu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawuka kandi saa tatu pamalavila, kavawona vandu vamonga vawoloka kusoku, vavahela chichuku cha kugola. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kavawombela, ‘muyendi kuchitava changu cha misabibu mukagoli chichuku, nenga dandivahombi ijala yenu.’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Topi, vayenda. Yula munachitava kawuka kandi saa sita pamusi na saa tisa kagola nga wuwula wula. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hata payifikili saa lilongu na limu palumihi, kawuka kandi, kavawona vandu vamonga vawoloka pala pasoku. Topi, kavadasha, ‘Mbona muwoloka apa pamusi posi ngajila kugola chichuku?’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vamuyangula, ‘Kwa nongwa kwahela mundu yatukemili tukagoli chichuku, mweni kavawombela na yumwi muyendi mukagoli chichuku cha muchitava changu cha misabibu.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Lijuva palihongili yula munachitava kamuwombela mkola mbiya waki, vakemi vagola chichuku uvahombi ijala yawu, ‘Ukandi na vala vafikili kumbeli, pambeli umalishili na vala vakwaa.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi, vayisa vala yivayisili saa lilongu na limu vapokela kila mundu ijala ya lijuva limu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vala va kwaa kufika pavafikili, vakacheyi davapokeli sitangalili, lakini veni vapata ngimu wuwula wula kila mundu ijala ya lijuva limu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vasipokela mbiya shawu, vakanda kumung'ong'utekela yula bambu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vadeta, ‘Ava vafikili kumbeli vagola chichuku cha kwa lisaa limu hela. Mbona kutugolela tulinganili na veni kunu yufwi twiwunishila tugola chichuku chikomi na lijuva likali lituyakila?’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Topi yula bambu kamuyangula yula muyawu yumu, ‘pikanishi ghanja, ngubanja chindu ng'odu! Twawombanili ng'odu na nenga, kucha ndivahombi ijala ya lijuva limu? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Toli ijala yaku, yendi, ngudayila kumupa ayu wa kumbeli mulinganili na yuwi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ndivahela haki ya kugola mali shangu ngimu wudayila ndimweni? Wuli, ukuwona weyi kwanongwa nenga ndiva msangi?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamalilila kwa kudeta, “Ndi dayivi nahawu, yivavelili kumbeli ponopa davavi vakwaa na vakwaa davavi va kumbeli pambeli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta kandi kusova na kushukuka kwa mweni</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 10:32-34, Lukasi 18:31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akuyenda kumbindi Yelusalemu, avatolili vala vanachuli lilongu na vavili pachifisu na paghaveyi mudeha kavawombela, <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mpikanishi! Tukuyenda Yelusalemu na aku Mwana wa Mundu davamuhadishi kwa mtambika mkomi na vawula va Malawu, veni davamuhighi awulayiwi kwa kumuvangilila mulupingika. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Davamuhadishi kwa vandu vangajila kumumanya Chapanga ili vamudanili, dalatuliwi ndomondu na kuvangiliwa mulupingika, lakini lijuva lya tatu kukandila pasovili, dashukushiwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chaaluva mawu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 10:35-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mdala wa Sebidayu amwisilili Yesu pamu na vana vaki, katundama pawulongolu yaki kumuluva chindu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamudasha, “Chiwudayila liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mawu yula kamuwombela, “Ngukuluva undangi muwutwa waku, ava vana vangu vavili vayikali yumu mwambu waku wa mlilu na wingi mwambu waku wa mkiyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kamuyangula, “Mumanya ha kucha mukuluva chindu liki. Mukuwesha kulandila lwindi lwa ndeshiwu danandili nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamuyangula, “Tukuwesha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka damulandili lwindi lunandila nenga, lakini kwikala kumulilu awu kumukiyi chichuku cha ya nenga ha, chindu achi davapati vala yivashawuliwili kala na Tati wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vala vanachuli vamonga lilongu pavapikanishili afi, vavalakalila vala valongu vavili. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kavakema, kavawombela, “Mumanya kucha vatavala va vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi vakutavala vandu vawu kwa mawovi na vakomi vala vakuvatavala vandu vawu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lakini kwa yumwi yikotoo kuva nahawu, ila yadayila kuva mkomi gati ya yumwi ghavi ndumindumi wa vosi, <verse number="27" style="v"/>na yadayila kuva wa kwaa gati ya yumwi ghavi ndumindumi wa yumwi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ndambu yiyeyi, Mwana wa Mundu kayisa kukimbanikiwa ha, ila kukimbanika na kutawula unofu waki kuva badili ya vandu vatangalili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vangalimesu vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 10:46-52, Lukasi 18:35-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akuwuka mbwani ya Yeliku, lipinga lya vandu lyamukovikelili. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Topi kwavelili na vangalimesu vavili vayikalili mumbalimbali ya deha, pavapikanishili kucha Yesu akupita pala, valandushili lishu, “Bambu, mwana wa Dawudi, wutuwoneli lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lila lipinga lya vandu livalakalila na kuvawombela vanyamali. Lakini veni valandusha nendu lishu, “Bambu mwana wa Dawudi, wutuwoneli lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kawoloka, kavakema na kuvadasha, “Mukudayila ndivagoleli liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vamuyangula, “Bambu, tukuluva tuloli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu kavawonela lusungu, kavagufya mesu vawu na tepu vawesha kulola, pambeli vamukovikela.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwingila Yelusalemu kwa filumbi</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 11:1-11, Lukasi 19:28-40, Yohani 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu na vanachuli vaki pavaveghi samba vafika Yelusalemu, vafikili tanila Betifage mufidunda fya miseyituni. Pala Yesu avalayishili vanachuli vaki vavili, <verse number="2" style="v"/>kavawombela, “Muyendi mbaka chijiji chiveli pawulongolu yenu damumuwoni chihongu vamuwopa pamu na ngwada waki. Muvawoposoli munyegheli. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Leki mundu pavadasha nongwa liki mukumuwopusola, mumuwombeli Bambu akumudayila na tepu mweni davawuyishili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Chilongu achi chagolili ili fila fidetiwili na mbuyi fivi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Muyiwombeli mbwani ya Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q">Loli, Mutwa waku akwisila!</para>
  <para style="q">Kava mshishamoyu na kayipakila chihongu,</para>
  <para style="q">ngwada wa chihongu, mwana wa chihongu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vala vanachuli vayenda vagola ngimu Yesu wavalayililili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vamuyegha yula chihongu pamu na mwana waki, vayala yingwa shawu kumuwongu ya vachihongwi na Yesu kayipaka kumuwongu yaki. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu vayala yingwa shawu mudeha na vandu vamonga vatemula miputila ya mibiki vayala mumbali mbali ya deha kumulibushila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mipinga ya vandu valongulili na vala vamukovikela valandusha lishu,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ajumiwi Mwana wa Dawudi!</para>
  <para style="q">Anemiliwi ayu yayisa kwa litawa lya Bambu!</para>
  <para style="q">Ajumiwi Chapanga kumbindi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akwingila Yelusalemu, mbwani yosi yimema njova. Vandu vakadasheyi, “Ayu ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vandu mulipinga lila vadeta, “Ayu ndi Yesu, mbuyi wa Chapanga kafuma Nasaleti mkowa wa Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvavinga vachulusi munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 11:15-19, Lukasi 19:45-48, Yohani 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu kayingila munyumba ya Chapanga, kavavingila panji vandu yivavelili vakuchuusa na kuhemela findu mugati ya nyumba ya Chapanga, kasibidula mesa sha vala yivaveyi vakufunja mbiya na figoda fya vala yivavelili vakuwula vanjiva. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Yiyandikiwa Mumayandiku Mang'alili, Chapanga kadeta, ‘Nyumba ya nenga yikukemiwa nyumba ya kudadavila.’ Lakini yumwi mupagola kuva mbaku ya vefi na vapoki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vangalimesu na vakwavakwava vamonga vamuyendilili aku kunyumba Ngomi ya Chapanga, Yesu kavalowola. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Topi, vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu vakalala pavayiwonili miwujawuja yagolili Yesu na vana pavaveghi vakulandula mashu vawu nyumba ya Chapanga pavadeta, “Lujumu kwa mwana wa Dawudi.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Topi, vamuwombela, “Kupikana ng'odu chivadeta?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kavayangula, “Yina ngupikana! Wuli musoma duhu mayandiku ava?</para>
  <para style="q">‘Kwa milomu ya vana vadokwa na fyali,</para>
  <para style="q">ukwipatila jumu yeni.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi, kavaleka kafuma panji ya mbwani na kuyenda Betaniya, aku kawonja.</para>
  <para style="s">Likuyu lingajila kulela</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:1-12, Lukasi 20:9-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pamavavila puti Yesu paghaveyi akuwuya kumbwani, katopa njala, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kaliwona libiki limu mumbalimbali ya deha kaliyendela lakini kaliwona livahela chindu ila mihamba weka. Topi, kaliwombela, “Kotoo kulela fivelekwa kandi jola!” Bahala pala libiki lila linyala. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vanachuli pavawonili nawula vajinga, vadeta, “Nongwa liki libiki ali linyala kalopu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Nakaka nguvawombela, leki pamuva na ujumilwa ngajila hoshu, mukuwesha kugola nahawu. Wekahela ha, ila hata pamuchiwombela chidunda achi ‘Tupuki kayilyasili mubahali,’ dachigoleki nahawu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pamuva na ujumilwa, chochosi damuluvi kwa kudadava damupati.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu chiyilata ukomi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 11:27-33, Lukasi 20:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kayingila munyumba ya Chapanga, akawuleyi. Pawuleyi mtambika mkomi na vavaha va vandu vamonga vamudasha, “Ukugola findu afi kwa uwesu wa ghani? Ghani yakupili uwesu awu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Na nenga nguvadasha chindu chimu, Pamunyangula na nenga dandivawombeli ngugola findu afi kwa uwesu wa ghani. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mung'ombeli uwesu wa Yohani mbatisha wafumili kwa ghani? Wafumili kwa Chapanga awu kwa vandu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini vawombana veni kwa veni naha, “Patudeta wafumili kumbindi daatudashi, ‘Mbona mwamjumilili ng'odu?’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Na patudeta, ‘Wafumili kwa vandu,’ tukutila lipinga lya vandu nongwa vosi vakujumila kucha Yohani mbatisha aveli mbuyi wa Chapanga.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Topi, vamuyangula, “Tumanya ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">Na Yesu kavawombela, “Na nenga dandivawombeli ha ngugola findu afi kwa uwesu wa ghani.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha vana vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Yumwi mwikwihola wuliwuli chilongu achi, Mundu yumu yaveli na vana vavili. Kamuwombela yula wa kwaa, ‘Mwana wangu nalelu yendi kagoli chichuku cha muchitava cha misabibu.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yula msongolu kamuwombela ‘Nema!’ Lakini pambeli kaghalambula natilu, kayenda kugola chichuku. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yula tati kamuwombela mwana waki wingi wuwowu, mweni kamuyangula ‘Yina tati nguyenda!’ Lakini kayenda kuchichuku ha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ponopa ghani gati ya ava vavili yagolili fyadayila tati waki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamuyangula, “Yula mwana soli.”</para>
  <para style="p">Topi, Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, yumwi mukali hela kwingila Muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, vasumula mbiya na vawoni davatali kwingila. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa Yohani mbatisha ayisili kwa yumwi kuvalangusha ya ugoleki ya kwikala, yumwi mumujumila ha. Lakini vasumula mbiya na vawoni vamujumila. Hata pamufiwonili afi fyosi yumwi mupomela na kujumila ha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha chitava cha misabibu na valimi</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:1-12, Lukasi 20:9-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kadeta, “Mpikanishi chilangushilu chingi. Mundu yumu muna nyumba alimili chitava cha misabibu, kachishengiteshela luviwu, pambeli kakumba lyowu lya kukamila misabibu, kajenga lidimililu. Pambeli kalihadika kwa valimi, mweni kawuka kayenda mwanja mtali mlima wingi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pachifikili chipindi cha kubena, avalayishili Vandumindumi vaki kwa vala valimi, ili vakatoli fimu fya fila fivabenili valimi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vala valimi vavakamula vala vandumindumi vamu vamutovanga na wingi vamuwulagha na yula wa tatu vamutovanga na miganga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mundu yula kavalayisha Vandumindumi vengi vatangalili kupita vala va mwanja mtasi. Vala valimi vavagola nga wuwula. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pambeli kamulayisha mwana waki kunu payihola kucha, ‘Davamtili mwana wangu.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lakini vala valimi pavamuwonili mwana waki vawombana veni kwa veni, ‘Ayu ndi muhala mbala. Tumuwulayi ili tutoli mbala yaki!’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Topi vamukamula, vamukweghela panji ya chitava chila cha misabibu, vamuwulagha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha, “Ponopa yula muna chitava cha misabibu payisa davagoli liki vala valimi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Veni vamuyangula, “Davawulaghi vala vandu vawafu na chitava chila davapi valimi vengi na pambeli vala valimi davamupi fimu fya fila fyavabena.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha, “Musoma duhu chindu achi mumayandiku vang'alili?</para>
  <para style="q">Ligonguveli lya kujengela livalemili vajengi,</para>
  <para style="q">ponopa liva ligonguveli likomi lya chikandilu.</para>
  <para style="q">Bambu ndi yagolili chilongu achi,</para>
  <para style="q">na chiva cha chiloja munu kwa yufwi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kayendelela kudeta, “Ponopa nguvawombela, wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga dawuwushiwi kwa yumwi na kuvapa vangajila kumumanya Chapanga na yivagola fyadayila Chapanga. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yaponikela pa ligonguveli ali dabenekibeneki na yula dalimponikeli dabajangiki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na Mafwalisayu pavapikanishili afi filangushilu fyaki vamanyili kucha aveli akuvadeta veni. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ponopa vakasakeyi deha ya kumvakula vamuwopi, lakini vatilili vandu kwanongwa veni vamumanyili mweni mbuyi wa Chapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha lihungu lya kuheta</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 14:15-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu adetili nawu kandi kwa chilangushilu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wifwana na Mutwa yamtandili mwana waki mlumi lihungu lya kuheta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi, kavakema Vandumindumi vaki kavalayisha, mukavalaliki vandu vayisi muhalusi, lakini yivalalikiwili valema kwisa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kavalayisha kandi Vandumindumi vamonga, kadeta, mukavawombeli vala vandivalalikili. ‘Lihungu lyangu liva kala, senga wangu yanunili kasinjiwa kala, kila chindu chiva kala, mwisi kulihungu!’ <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini veni vatinuka ha, vayenda, yumu kuchitava chaki na wingi kayenda kufichuku fyaki, <verse number="6" style="v"/>na vamonga vavakamula vala Vandumindumi vavajowola na kuvawulagha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yula mutwa kakalala, kavalayila vamachonda vaki vakavamalili vala vavawulayili vayawu na kubohola mbwani yawu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela Vandumindumi vaki, ‘Lihungu liva kala, lakini valalikiwa vangajila kulatiwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi, muyendi kunjila mukavawombeli vandu vovosi vala, mukavayeghi vayisi kulihungu.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vala Vandumindumi vawuka, vayenda kunjila, vavayegha vandu vosi, vawafu na vanofu. Mbaka nyumba ya vahenja yamemili,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Mutwa payingilili kavalola vahenja, kamuwona mundu yumu yafwalili ng'odu yingwa ya lihungu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mutwa kamudasha, ‘Ghanja kwingila wuliwuli apa ngajila yingwa ya lihungu?’ Lakini mweni kayikala jii. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi, mutwa kavawombela vandumindumi vaki, ‘Mumuwopi mawulu na mawoku mukamuyasi panji muchisi, aku dalili na kugelujula minu,’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamalilila kwa kudeta, “Valalikiwili vatangala, ila vadokwa yivashawuliwili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhomba kodi kwa Mutwa wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:13-17, Lukasi 20:20-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu vayenda, vawombana ndambu ya kumuwomesha Yesu kwa filongu fyaki. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pambeli, vavalayisha Vandundami wawu pamu na Vandundami va lipinga lya Helodi vamudasha, “Muwula, tukumanya kucha yuwi kuva mundu wa nakaka na ukuwula nakaka deha ya Chapanga kwa ugoleki, ukumtila mundu yoyosi ha, kwanongwa ukomi wa mundu kwa yuwi chindu ha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ponopa wutuwombeli chiwihola, yiva nyanyi awu ng'odu kuhomba kodi kwa Mutwa wa Loma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu amanyili kala milandu yawu ya wafu, kavawombela, “Yumwi muvafyangu mbona mukunyesha? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Munangushi mbiya ya kuhombela kodi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamulangusha ligwala lya mbiya. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu kavadasha, “Wushu na lihundu ali lya ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Vamuyangula, “Mutwa wa Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kavawombela, “Nyanyi, fya Mutwa wa Loma mumupi Mutwa wa Loma na fya Chapanga mumupi Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pavapikanishili naha vayikanganika, vamuleka, veni vayenda.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha kushukuka</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:18-27, Lukasi 20:27-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lijuva lila, Masadukayu vamu vadeta, yivasovili vakushukuka ng'odu. Vamu vamwisila Yesu vamuwombela, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Muwula, Musa adetili mdala pasova mbendi, yula ngalimlyangu ahaliwi na mlongumundu, ili amuleleli vana mlongumundu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Topi, pavelili na valongu saba. Soli ahetili pambeli kasova mbendi, kahaliwa kandi na mlongu wingi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yiva wuwowu hata kwa mlongu wingi wa tatu, mbaka mlongu wa saba. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pavasovili valongu vosi na yula ngalimlyangu asovili wuwowu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ponopa lijuva pavashukuka vala yivasovili daghavi mdala wa ghani? Kwa vala valumi saba yivasovili? Kwa nongwa vosi saba vamutolili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Yumwi muvifya kwanongwa mumanya ha Mayandiku Vang'alili wala liwovi lya Chapanga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nongwa yivasovili pavashukuka davaheti ha wala kuhetiwa, davavi kucha Makungu wa Chapanga. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lakini kwilata kushukuka yivasovili, wuli, musoma ng'odu fila fyavawombilili Chapanga? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Chapanga kadeta, ‘Nenga ndiva Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na Chapanga wa Isaka na Chapanga wa Yakobi!’ Topi mweni Chapanga wa yivasovili ha ila ndi Chapanga wa yivaveli vanofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lila lipinga lya vandu pavapikanishili naha liyikang'anika ng'ulilu yaki.</para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ngomi</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:28-34, Lukasi 10:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu pavapikanishili kucha Masadukayu vavahela chilongu chingi cha kumdasha Yesu, vayikungulili pamu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Muyawu yumu aveli mundu wa Malawu, ayeshili kumdasha Yesu kwa kumuyesha. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Amudashili, “Muwula, amuli liki yiveli ngomi munu pitu shosi mumalawu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Mtami Bambu Chapanga waku kwa ndima yaku yosi na kwa fuki yaku na kwa luhala lwaku losi: <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ali ndi lilawu likomi na lyakwaa. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ya pili yikwifwana na ayi, ‘Mtami mjofi waku kucha witama umweni.’ <verse number="40" style="v"/>Malawu vosi va Musa na mayandiku va vambuyi va Chapanga vakwiyidumbila Malawu mavili ava.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu Chimwilata Kilistu Mkombola</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:35-37, Lukasi 20:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu pavayikungili pamu, Yesu avadashili, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Yumwi mukuwona wuliwuli chilongu achi chimwilata Kilistu Mkombola? Wuli, kava mwana wa lukolu liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamuyangula, “Wa lukolu lwa Dawudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Topi, yikuva wuliwuli kucha kwa liwovi lya Mfuki Mng'alili Dawudi akumkema mweni Bambu? Kwa nongwa adetili.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>‘Bambu amuwombilili Bambu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">Wuyikali mwabu wanenga wa mlilu:</para>
  <para style="q">mbaka ndivaviki mangandawu vaku pasi ya mawulu vaku.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Topi, leki Dawudi akumkema Mkombola Bambu, yikuva wuliwuli Mkombola ghavi mwana wa Dawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kwa hela mundu yoyosi yaweshili kumuyangula chilongu. Na kukandila lijuva lililalila kwa hela yagelili kumudasha chindu.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakayika vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:38-39, Lukasi 11:43-46, 20:45-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kaliwombela lipinga lya vandu pamu na vanachuli vaki, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kadeta, “Vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu vana uwesu wa kudeta kwanongwa Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ponopa mukamuli na kugola chochosi chadayila kavawombela. Lakini mukotoo kutapula fila fyavagolili, kwanongwa vakugola ha fila fivalandula. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vakuwopa misiwu misitu na kuvatwika vandu mumakombi, lakini veni vakulema hata kuyesha kupapa padiki. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Veni vakugola findu ili vandu vavajumi. Vakufwala viniku sivelili na mayandiku va Malawu pawushu na mumawoku yawu. Na vakufwala mihabiti yawu yivelili na miviniku mikomi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vakudayila fwasi nofu mulihungu na kwikala mufigoda fya hishima munyumba sha kudadavila. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vakudayila kujambushiwa kwa ndundamilu musoku na vakudayila kukemiwa na vandu, ‘muwula’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini yumwi mukotoo kukemiwa ‘muwula,’ kwanongwa muwula wenu yumu hela na mwavosi yumwi muva munyumba yimu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wala mukotoo kumukema mundu yoyosi ‘Tati’ pa mlima awu kwanongwa Tati wenu yumu hela, yaveli kumbindi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wuwula wula mukotoo kukemiwa ‘fiwongosi,’ kwanongwa chiwongosi wenu yumu hela, Kilistu Mkombola. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yaveli mkomi kwa yumwi ndi ghavi ndumindumi wa yumwi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yaitutumula dapohomushiwi na yaipohumosha datutumuliwi na Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuuvipa ufyangu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 12:40, Lukasi 11:39-42,44,52,20:47</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Pishu, yumwi vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu, vafyangu! Mukuvatatila vandu mlyangu wa wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Na mwaveni mukwingila ha mugati, wala mukuvayingisha ha vandu yivadayila kwingila vayingili. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pishu, yumwi vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu, yumwi mukuvapughapugha vangalimlyangu na kutola findu fyawu na kudadava ngumbilu ndali ili kuyilangusha kwa vandu. Kwa nongwa ayi asabu yenu dayivi ngomi nendu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Pishu, yumwi vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu, yumwi vafyangu! Mukutyanga kujabuka bahali na milima yitangalili ili muweshi kumughalambula mundu ajumili kucha wumujumila yumwi. Pamupata mukuwesha kumgola mwana ayendi mumotu wa lifumbika nendu pitu yumwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Pishu yumwi fiwongosi ngalimesu! Yumwi mukudeta, ‘Kucha, mundu payilapa kwa nyumba ya Chapanga, malapu ava chindu ha, Lakini payilapa kwanongwa chumang'andu ya nyumba ya Chapanga, malapu ava vakumkamula.’ <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yumwi ngalimesu vapufi! Choti chitawukili nendu, Chumang'andu awu nyumba ya Chapanga yiigola ayi chumang'andu kuva ying'alili? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kandi mukuvawula, ‘Kucha, mundu payilapa pa fyalu pa kutambikila chindu ha, lakini payilapa kwa fupu yivikiwili pambindi ya fyalu pa kutambikila, malapu vala vakumukamula,’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yumwi ngalimesu! Choti chiveli na mana munu, Yila fupu awu pala fyalu, paligoliwa litambiku livi ling'alili? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mundu yayilapa kwa mahali pa kutambikila litambiku, kayilapa kwa mahali pa fyalu na kwa chochosi chivikiwili pambindi yaki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na yailapa kwa nyumba ya Chapanga, kayilapa kwa yila Nyumba ya kudadavila na wuwula wula kwa Chapanga yula yayikala mugati. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na yailapa kwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, kayilapa kwa chigoda cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na kwa Chapanga yula yayikalilili chigoda achi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Pishu yumwi vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu, vafyangu! Vakumugayila Chapanga chindu chimu kwa kila findu lilongu, hata kwa mihamba yiveli na nyambulilu nofu, myaya na mingwema, kunu mukufileka findu fiveli fitalama fya Malawu kucha kugola fyadayila Chapanga, haki na lusungu na ujumilwa findu afi fitawuka mukudayiliwa kufigola ngajila kuyivasuwa fila fimonga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Fiwongosi ngalimesu! Mukujabula chindu chidokwa kucha vangosi mufindu fya kulandila, lakini mukumila findu fikomi kucha ndembu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Pishu yumwi vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu, vafyangu! Mukung'ofuwa lwindi na bakuli kwa panji, lakini mugati mukukuleka mumema findu mufipatili kwa njila ya kuvapoka na ubafu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mafwalisayu ngalimesu! Hofuwi lwindi mugati tanila na panji dakuvi nyanyi wuwowu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Pishu yumwi vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu, vafyangu! Muva kucha sembi. Sivashaghishili kwa panji sikuwoneka kuva nyanyi, lakini mgati mumema mipava ya chikongu na ndambu ya wafu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wuwowu yumwi mukuwoneka kwa vandu kwa panji muva vasangi, lakini kwa mugati mumema ufyangu na wafu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akutunga highilu yawu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 11:47-51</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Pishu yumwi vawula va Malawu na Mafwalisayu, vafyangu! Mukujenga sembi sha vambuyi na kumelimetesha sembi sha vandu goleki. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mukudeta kucha yufwi tungaveli chipindi cha vavaha vetu tungaveli pamu ha kuvawulagha vambuyi! <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ponopa mukutovilela mwaveni baha kucha muva vana va vandu vavawulayi vambuyi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Topi, ponopa mugolikeshi chichuku yila yivakandili vavaha venu! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yumwi njoka yaveli na usungu! Mukuwesha wuliwuli kwilyepa kuhighilu ya motu wa lifumbika? <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ndi nongwa nenga nguvayeghela mbuyi, vandu yivaveli na luhunja na vawula va Malawu, damuvawulayi na kumvangilila mulupingika vamonga vamu na vamonga damuvalatuli na fiboku munyumba ya kudadavila yenu na kuvasaka mbwani shosi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Topi, mbatiwa yosi dayivapati kwanongwa ya mwasi wosi wa vandu goleki wumwayikili muuganga, yina kukandila kumwayika kwa mwasi wa Abeli yaveli ngajila nongwa mbaka yila ya Sakaliya mwana wa Balakiya, yimumuwulayili munyumba ya Chapanga muchumba gati ya pang'alili na pafyalu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, chileli achi dachipati asabu kwanongwa ya njifwa asi.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndambu Yesu wayitama mbwani ya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 13:34-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Yelusalemu! Deku Yelusalemu! Ukuvawulaya Vambuyi na kuvatovanga miganga vala valayishiwili kwa yuwi. Kaningi nyesha kuvakunga vana vaku kwa nenga kucha wula nguku pakunga vana vaki mwifungu ya mbapatilu shaki, lakini mulema. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Topi loli, nyumba yaku Chapanga dayilekiwi domoo! <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ngukuwombela, dawung'oni kandi ha mbaka pawudeta: ‘Anemiliwi ayu yayisayu kwa litawa lya Bambu.’ ”</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuywangila kubowuliwa Nyumba Ngomi ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 13:1-2, Lukasi 21:5-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kafuma Munyumba ya Chapanga na paghaveyi akuyenda, vanachuli vaki vamuyendilili, vamulangusha ndambu yivamelimetishili kwa migonguveli ya nyanyi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yina, mukuwesha kusilola asi shosi! Nakaka nguvawombela, kwahela hata ligonguveli limu dalisighali kumbindi ya ligonguveli limonga, kila chindu dachibowuliwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Tabu na gobuleku</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 13:3-13, Lukasi 21:7-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi kayikala pachidunda cha Miseyituni, vanachuli vamuyendilili pachisikafu, vamudasha, “Tuwombeli, findu afi dafivi ndili? Dachilangushiwi chilangushilu liki kwisa kwa yuwi na mwishu wa chipindi?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Muyivavali, mukotoo kujangiwa na mundu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kwanongwa davabwituki vandu vatangalili vakwisa, pavadeta kucha, ‘mweni ndi Kilistu Mkombola!’ Na veni davavayushi vandu vatangalili. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Damupikanishi lupwepu lwa ngondu pabehi na kutali, lakini mukotoo kutila, kwanongwa afi dafibwituki, lakini mwishu weni wakali. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vandu va mlima wumu dawulevi na mlima wingi, wutwa wumu dawulevi na wutwa wingi. Kosi dakuvi na njala na liyighayigha mlima wonda. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Fyosi afi ndalishu hela kucha matami chipindi chakulela mwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Pambeli davavatawuli ili mugobuliwi na kuwulayiwa. Vandu va milima yosi dayivanyekwi kwanongwa ya nenga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vatangalili davayileki ujumilwa wawu, davayivifyi na kuyinyekwa veni kwa veni. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Davabwituki vambuyi va udesi vatangalili davavayaghamishi vandu vatangalili, <verse number="12" style="v"/>kwanongwa ya kuyongisheka filongu fya wafu, vandu davayitami nendu ha. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini mundu yayiwunishila mbaka kumbelu ayu ndi dalowuliwi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ila mwishu wukali hela kufika, achi chilongu cha nyanyi cha wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga dachilanduliwi mlima wosi kucha utovileli kwa vandu kufuma makabila vosi vangajila kumumanya Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Chindu cha wafu chikuwesha kuvifya Nyumba Ngomi ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 13:14-23, Lukasi 21:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Topi, pamuwona chindu cha wafu chikuwesha kuvifya Nyumba Ngomi ya Chapanga, manyi yula yadetiwili na Mbuyi wa Chapanga Daniyeli pawolushiwa mahali pang'alili. Mundu yasoma amanyi mana yaki. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Topi, yivaveli Yudeya vatuvilili kufidunda.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na yaveli palipaghali akotoo kusunuka kutola chindu munyumba yaki. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yaveli kufitava akotoo kuwuya kumbeli kutola yingwa yaki. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pishu, kwa vadadala yivaveli na ndumbu na yivayongesha majuva va mbelu! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mudadavi ili nduvilu yenu yikotoo kuva lijuva lya lupepu awu lijuva lya kupumulila! <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mana chipindi achi dachivi na siki ngomi yingajila kuwoneka kukandila kulumbiwa kwa mlimawu mbaka nalelu, wala dayibwituki kandi ha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Leki majuva ava yangayangishiwili ng'odu, kwahela mundu yoyosi angalowuliwili, lakini majuva ava davayangishiwi na Chapanga kwanongwa ya vala yivashawuliwili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Topi, kwa majuva vesava mundu pavawombela: ‘Kilistu Mkombola kava apa’ awu ‘kava pala,’ Mkotoo kujumila. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa davabwituki va Kilistu va ufyangu na Vambuyi va udesi na davagoli chilangushilu chikomi na mihilu ya kuwesha kuvayaghamisha, yikuweshikana hata kwa vala vashawuliwili na Chapanga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mpikanishi, yumwi ndavakayikili kala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Topi, pavavawombela, ‘Muloli, kava kucheja, mukotoo kuyenda aku’ awu pavavawombela, ‘Kayififa munyumba, mukotoo kujumila.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa kucha lumuli palung'alika kufuma kundamba mbaka kuuhehi, ndi dayivi kwisa kwa mwana wa mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Pala pawuvelili mtugulu, vandapu vakwikungasha baha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwisa kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 13:24-27, Lukasi 21:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kalopu payiveyi siki majuva vala, dakuvi na chisi wuluwulu na limbalamwesi daliloleki ha, ndondwa dasiponeki kufuma kumbindi kululanga na liwovi lya kumbindi dalitikanyishwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pambeli, chilangushilu cha mwana wa Mundu dachiwoneki kululanga na makabila vosi va mlimawu davawuti, davamuwoni Mwana wa Mundu payisa kumbindi ya mafundi va kululanga na liwovi na ukomi utangalili. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mweni davalayishi Makungu vaki yivaveli na limbalapi lya kulamika munu davakungashi vashawuliwili kufuma mbembu shosi mchechi sha mlimawu, kufuma mwishu awu wa lulanga mbaka mwishu wingi.</para>
  <para style="s">Muyiwuli kwa kulilola likuyu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 13:28-31, Lukasi 21:29-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Kwa likuyu muyiwuli chilangushilu awu: Tepu mitafyi yaki payikanda kuva miteki na kuyalula mukumanya kucha ndonya ya pabehi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wuwowu yumwi pamuwona findu afi fyosi pafigoleka, mumanyi kucha Mwana wa Mundu samba ayisi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, chileli achi chipiti ng'odu ngajila filongu fyosi afi kugoleka. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lulanga na mlima dafipiti, lakini filongu fyangu dafipiti ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwahela yamanya lijuva wala saa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 13:32-37, Lukasi 17:26-30, Lukasi 17:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Liyilata lijuva awu saa, kwahela mundu yamanyili kucha dayivi ndili, wala Makungu va kumbindi kwa Chapanga, wala Mwana, ila Tati weka yaki ndi yamanyili. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kucha payiveyi chipindi cha Nuhu, nga wuwula wula dayivi kwisa kwa Mwana wa Mundu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nongwa chipindechi, lilava likomi lya njifwa likali hela, vandu vaveli vakulya na kulanda, pavaheta na kuhetiwa, mbaka Nuhu payingilili muwula watu mkomi wuvawukema Safina. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vamanyili ha kucha kuna liki mbaka chila lilawa likomi lya njifwa palibwitukili, likuvawona vosi. Ayi dayivi hata chipindi Mwana wa mundu payisa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Chipindechi vandu vavili davavi kufitava: Yumu datoliwi na monga dalekiwi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vadadala vavili davavi vakulibula majani, yumu datoliwi na monga dalekiwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Topi, mugungi mesu, kwanongwa mulimanya ha lijuva Bambu wenu dayisi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lakini muyiholi chilongu achi! Kucha muna nyumba angamanyili lijuva lyafika mwifi, angagungili mesu, angayilekili ha nyumba yaki vabowoli. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ponopa yumwi muvi ndemindemi, kwanongwa Mwana wa Mundu dayisi chipindi mungajila kuchimanya”.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndumindumi goleki na yangajila ugoleki</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 12:41-48</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu kayendelela kudeta, “Topi, ndi ndumindumi goleki na yaveli na luhunja, Bambu mundu daamuviki pambindi ya vandu vaki na kumuwombela avapi filivi fyawu kwa chipindi cheni? <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ngiba yula ndumindumi Bambu mundu payisa damuwoni pagola chichuku cha yila. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, damuviki ndumindumi ayu awolukeli mali vaki vosi. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Leki kucha Vandumindumi yangajila goleki payidetela mundima, ‘Bambu wangu kakelwa kuwuya, <verse number="49" style="v"/>pambeli akukanda kuvatova vandumindumi vamonga na kukanda kulya na kulanda pamu na vanjayila.’ <verse number="50" style="v"/>Topi, Bambu mundu payisa lijuva na chipindi chingajila kumanyika. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Damupi asabu ngomi na kumuvika lipinga limu na vafyangu. Aku dalili na kugelujula minu.”</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mfwanu wa vakavali lilongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Chipindechi Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga dawuyifwani na vakavali lilongu yivatolili taa shawu, vayenda kumuyanga Bambu lihungu lya kuheta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Muhanu wa vala vaveli vapufi na muhanu yivaveli vana luhunja. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vala vapufi vatolili taa shawu, lakini vatolili ha mafuta va kutaya mula. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini vala yivaveli na luhunja vatolili mafuta musupa pamu na taa shawu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kumbi Bambu lihungu lya kuheta kakelwa kwisa, vala vakavali vosi vasisila, pambeli vawonja.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Payifikili pamihi mandandu, kwavelili na chowu ‘Topi, topi! Bambu wa lihungu akwisa, muyendi mukamuyangi!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli vala vakavali vosi vatandamuka, vasitandali taa shawu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vala vapufi vavawombela vala yivaveli na luhunja, ‘Mututayili mafuta venu padokwa, taa shetu sikujimika.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lakini vala yivaveli na luhunja vavawombela, ‘Ava davatukwili ha yufwi na yumwi! Ngiba muyendi kuduka mukayihemileli!’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi, vala vakavali vapufi pavayendili kuhemela mafuta, kumbeli kunu Muheta kafika na vala vakavali vaveli kala vayingila pamu na mweni munyumba ya muheta, pavayingilili kala mlyangu wutatiwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Pambeli vala vakavali vapufi vayisa, vakema, ‘Bambu, Bambu, wutufuwulili! <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini mweni kavayangula, nguvawombela nakaka, yumwi ndivamanya ha.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kadeta, “Topi, mugungi mesu, kwanongwa mumanya ha lijuva wala saa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mfwanu wa vandumindumi vatatu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 19:11-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Chipindechi wutwa wa kumbindi dawuvi kucha mundu yumu yadayileyi kuyenda mwanja. Avakemili vandumindumi vaki, kavahadisha mali shaki. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Amupili kila mundu kulinganila na chifwani chaki, yumu amupili mbiya kucha ijala ya mwesi wumu, wingi mbiya kucha ijala ya majuma mavili na wingi kamupa mbiya kucha sha ijala ya lijuma limu, pambeli kayenda mwanja. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tepu yula yagayiliwili mbiya sha ijala ya mwesi wumu kagolela uchulusi kayegha singi nga sisila, <verse number="17" style="v"/>wuwula wula na yula yagayiliwili mbiya sha ijala ya majuma mavili kagolela uchulusi kayegha singi nga sisila. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lakini yula yagayiliwili mbiya sha juma limu, kayenda kakumba lyowu kasikulila pasi mbiya sila sha bambu waki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Yula bambu payikalili aku lyoo! Pawuyili kakanda kukawula tolitoli ya mbiya sivelili na sivapatili. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yula ndumindumi yagayiliwili mbiya sha mwesi wumu kayisa na mbiya singi nga sisila sila, kamuwombela, ‘Bambu, wanyimbili mbiya sha ijala ya mwesi wumu, apa siyongisheka singi nga sisila sila.’ <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bambu mundu kamuwombela, ‘Nyanyi, kuva ndumindumi msangi na mwaminifu, kuva mwaminifu kwa findu fidokwa ponopa dandikugoli mwaminifu kwa findu fikomi, wisi sekileli pamu na bambu waku!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Ndumindumi yagayiliwili mbiya sha ijala ya majuma mavili na mweni kayisa, kadeta, ‘Bambu, wanyimbili mbiya sha ijala ya majuma mavili, ponopa loli kuna mbiya simonga nga sisilasila simbatili.’ <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bambu mundu kamuwombela, ‘Nyanyi ndumindumi msangi na mwaminifu, kuva mwaminifu wa chindu chidokwa, dandikupi findu fingi fikomi. Wisi sekileli pamu na bambu waku.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Pambeli kayisa yula ndumindumi yagayiliwili mbiya sha ijala ya juma limu, kadeta, ‘Bambu nenga manya kucha yuwi kuva mundu yudindalili, yuwi ukubena pala pawungajila kukweta na kukunganya pala pawungajila kuvaghasha. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ndatilili, ndayifisili mbiya yaku muuganga. Topi toli mbiya yaku.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Bambu mundu kamuwombela, ‘Yuwi kuva ndumindumi mwafu na mgata! Wamanyili kucha nenga ngubena mahali pangajila kukweta na kukunganya pala pangajila kuvaghasha. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ngiba, ningavikili mbiya shangu kwa vatawula fiyongishekeli yikopesha ningatolili na fwayida yaki! <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi, mumupoki mbiya asi mukamupi yula mundu muna mbiya sha ijala ya mwesi wumu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nongwa yaveli na chindu dagayiliwi na kuyongishiwa. Lakini yula ngajila chindu, dawupokiwi hata chila chidokwa chavelinachu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na ayu ndumindumi yangajila fwayida, mumuyasi panji muchisi! Aku dalili na kugelujula minu.’</para>
  <para style="s">Highilu ya mbelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Chipindi Mwana wa Mundu yavelili ndi Mutwa payisa muukomi waki pamu na makungu vaki vang'alili, topi dayikali pachigoda chaki cha wutwa chi vaveli na ukomi waki, <verse number="32" style="v"/>vandu va milima yosi dayiyikunguli pawulongolu yaki na mweni davabawuli vandu kucha mdima yavatapula vafungami na vameni. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Davavaviki vandu yivagola fyadayila Chapanga wa mlilu na kuvabava vala yivagola ng'odu fyadayila Chapanga mwambu waki wamkiyi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pambeli Mutwa davawombeli vala yivaveli mwambu waki wa mlilu, ‘Mwisi yumwi yimunemiliwili na Tati wenu, mupokeli wutwa wuvavatalishili kukandila kulumba kwa mlima. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nongwa ndavelili na njala yumwi mwanyimbili na ndavelili nyumilwa yumwi mwanyimbili machi vakulanda na ndavelili muhenja yumwi mwanibushilili, <verse number="36" style="v"/>na ndaveli ngelengi, mufwalisha na ndavelili mtami yumwi mwayisili kunola na ndavelili muchijaka yumwi mwayisili kundyangila!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Topi, vandu vala yivagolili fya dayila Chapanga davamuyanguli Mutwa, ‘Bambu, ndili twakuwonili kuna njala yufwi twakupili filivi, awu kuyumilwa yufwi twakupili machi va kulanda? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ndili waveli muhenja yufwi twakulibushilili na ndili twakuwonili kuva ngelengi yufwi tukufwalisha? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na ndili twakuwonili kuva mtami awu kuva muchijaka yufwi twisa kukulola?’ <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mutwa davayanguli, ‘Nakaka nguvawombela, kila chindu chimuvagolili vamu wa ava vana vangu vadokwa, mwagolili nenga.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Pambeli Mutwa davawombeli vala yivaveli mwambu waki wa mkiyi, ‘Muwuki pawulongolu ya nenga yumwi mulapiliwili! Muyendi mulifumbika lya jola litandiwiwili na Lijangavandu pamu na vandumindumi vaki. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nongwa ndaveli nyumilwa yumwi munyimba ha machi va kulanda. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ndaveli muhenja yumwi munibushila ha, ndaveli mtami na kuwopiwa muchijaka yumwi mwisa ha kunola.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Na veni davayanguli, ‘Bambu, ndili twakuwonili kuva na njala awu kuyumilwa, kuva muhenja awu kuva ngelengi awu kuva mtami na kuwopiwa muchijaka yufwi tukukimbanikila ng'odu?’ <verse number="45" style="v"/>Na mweni davayanguli, ‘Nguvawombela nakaka, kila chindu chimulemili kuvagolela vandu vangajila kujakwa kucha ava, mwalemili kugolela nenga.’ <verse number="46" style="v"/>Topi, ava davayendi mumotu wa jola wa lifumbika, lakini vala yivagola fyadayila Chapanga davayendi muunofu wa jola.”</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Milandu ya kumuwulagha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:1-2, Lukasi 22:1-2, Yohani 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pamalili kudeta fila fyosi, kavawombela vanachuli vaki, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Mumanya kucha pavapita majuva mavili dakuvi na Lihungu lya pasaka na Mwana wa mundu davakuliwi ili avangiliwi mulupingika”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chipindechi vatambika vakomi na vavaha na vandu vatangalili vayikunga pamu munyumba ya mtambika mkomi yakemiwa Kayafa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vawombana ndambu ya kumukamula Yesu kwa chifisu ili vamuwulayi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Kumbi vawombana veni chilongu achi chikotoo kugoleka chipindi cha pasaka, ili yikotoo kubwituka ndilingu pa vandu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kashaghiwa mafuta aku Betaniya</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:3-9, Yohani 12:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi Betaniya, kayaki Simoni, munautami wa mwiku, <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mawu yumu yavelili na supa ya alabasta yiveli na mafuta va kunungilila vatalamili, amwisilili pala pamesa paghalyeyi filivi, kamuyitilila vala mafuta va kunungilila kumutwi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki pavawonili afi vakalala, vadeta, “Asala ayi ya liki? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mafuta ava va kunungilila vangaweshili kuwuliwa kwa mbiya ngomi na vagaju vagayiliwi mbiya asi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu amanyili hoshu shawu, kavawombela, “Mbona mukumuyasha mawu ayu? Mweni kagolela chilongu cha nyanyi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vagaju muva pamu majuva vosi, lakini nenga dandivi pamu na yumwi majuva wosi ha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ayu mawu kanyitilila mafuta va kunungilila akandalisheyi kwa kusikiwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, poposi pa mlima awu chilongu achi dachilanduliwi, Chilongu cha Nyanyechi cha golili mawu ayu dachitambuliwi kwa ngumbungumbu ya mweni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda akujumila kumshengeta Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:10-11, Lukasi 22:3-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pambeli Yudasi Sikaliyoti, yumu wa vala lilongu na vavili, kayenda kwa mtambika mkomi, <verse number="15" style="v"/>kavawombela, “Damunyimbi chindu liki kucha pandimuhadika Yesu kwa yumwi?” Vamuvalangila migwala milongu mitatu ya mbiya, <verse number="16" style="v"/>kukandila chipindi achi Yuda akasakeyi fwasi nofu ya kumshengeta Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulya Pasaka pamu na vanachuli</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:12-21, Lukasi 22:7-13, Lukasi 22:21-23, Yohani 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lijuva lya kwaa kabula ya Lihungu lya mibumunda yingajila simika, vanachuli vamuyendilili Yesu vamudasha, “Ukudayila tukakutandili koti filivi fya Pasaka?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mweni kavayangula, “Muyendi kumbwani kwa mlulumi tunga, mukamuwombeli, Muwula kadeta, ‘Chipindi cha nenga chifika, kwa yuwi kulya pasaka pamu na vanachuli vangu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vanachuli vagola kucha Yesu vavalayilili, vatanda filivi fya Lihungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Payifikili palumihi Yesu ayikalili pamesa pamu na vanachuli vaki lilongu na vavili. <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Nguvawombela nakaka, mundu yumu gati ya yumwi dashyengeti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vanachuli vang'ong'oteka munu, vakanda kumudasha yumu yumu, “Bambu! Ghani, nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Yalikishila ndongi muchimbundi pamu na nenga ndi dashyengeti. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yina Mwana wa Mundu akuyenda kucha Mayandiku vang'alili wuvadeta, ila, pishu mundu yula damshengeti Mwana wa Mundu! Ingaveli ngiba mundu ayu angawonikili ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pambeli Yudasi yadayileyi amshengeti Yesu, kamdasha, “muwula! Ndiva nenga duu?” Yesu kamuyangula, “Yina, ukudeta yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Filivi fya Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:22-26, Lukasi 22:14-20, 1 Vakolindu 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pavaveghi vakulya, Yesu katola libumunda, kamlumba Chapanga, kalimetula, kavapa vanachuli vaki kunu padeta, “Mtoli mulyi, awu ndi mvili wa nenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli katola lwindi, kalumba, kavapa kunu padeta, “Mulandi mwavosi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa awu ndi mwasi wangu wuumanyisha lilaghanu, mwasi wuumwayika kwanongwa ya vandu vosi ili kuvawushila sambi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nguvawombela, danandi kandi ha difwayi ya misabibu mbaka lijuva lingi pananda kandi pamu na yumwi muwutwa wa Tati wangu” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pasomulili kala msambu, kawuka kayenda muchidunda cha Miseyituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akutunga kucha Petili daamlemi</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:27-31, Lukasi 22:31-34, Yohani 13:36-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela, “Pamihi panu, yumwi mwavosi damutuvi na kuneka weka yangu, nongwa Mayandiku Vang'alili vakudeta,</para>
  <para style="q">Chapanga kadeta, ‘dandimtovi mdimi,</para>
  <para style="q">na vafungami davapwililiki.’</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kumbi nenga pashukukili kala dandivalonguleli aku Galilaya.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Petili kamuwombela Yesu, “Hata kucha vosi davavi na lyogha na yuwi na kukuleka, nenga dandikuleki ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Nakaka ngukuwombela, pamihi panu njowolu akali hela kuvika, dawunemi myanja mitatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Petili kamuyangula, “Hata leki mani lasima nzovi pamu na yuwi nenga dandikuleki ng'odu.” Na vala vanachuli vamonga vosi vayangula nga wuwula wula.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aku Getisimani</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:32-42, Lukasi 22:39-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayenda pamu na veni kuchitava cha mibiki cha Getisemani, kavawombela, vanachuli vaki, “Mwikali apa, leki nenga nyendi pala pawulongolu ngadadavi.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kavatola Petili, Yakobi na Yohani vana va Sebidayu vakanda kuva na ng'ong'u na kugudaguda. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Topi, kavawombela, “Ndina lung'ong'u lukomi mundima mbaka samba sova. Mwikali apa mugungi pamu na nenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Topi, kayenda paulongolu padokwa, kawa wuyifuma, kadadava “Tati wangu, kucha payiweshikana, lwindi alu lunewuki ila yikotoo kuva kucha wudayila nenga, ila kucha wudayila yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kavawuyila vala vanachuli kavawona vawonja. Kamuwombela, “Petili nakaka muwesha ha kugunga pamu na nenga hata kwa lisaa limu? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mugungi na kudadava ili mukotoo kwingila mumayeshu. Mfuki wukudayila lakini mvili wuva msosuvafu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kayenda kandi mwanja wa pili kadadava, “Tati wangu, kucha yikuweshikana ng'odu lwindi alu lumbiti ngajila nenga kulanda, topi, fiwudayila yuwi figoleki.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kavawuyila kandi kavawona vawonja, kwanongwa mesu vawu vaveli wuniwuni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Topi, kavaleka, kayenda kandi kudadava mwanja wa tatu kwa lisu lililalila. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawuyila vanachuli vaki, kavawombela, “Mkalihela mukawonja na kupumulila? Mloli! Chipindi cheni chifika, Mwana wa Mundu davamuhadishi mumawoku ya vandu vavelili na sambi <verse number="46" style="v"/>Muyimuki, tuyendi. Mloli! Akwisa yula danshengeti.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:43-50, Lukasi 22:47-53, Yohani 18:3-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu paghaveyi akali hela akuwombana nawu, kabwituka Yudasi yumu wa vala lilongu na vavili, akwisa pamu na vandu vamonga yivaveli na mipanga na fimbongu. Yivavelili valayishiwa na vatambika vakomi na vavaha va vandu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ayu yadayileyi kumushengeta Yesu, aveli kavapa kala chilangushilu padeta kucha, “Mundu yula yindimjambusha kwa kumunoneli ndi mweni, mumuvakuli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Topi Yuda kamselilela Yesu, kamujambusha “Hasi muwula,” Pambeli kamunonela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Ghanja, goli chiwudayileyi kugola.”</para>
  <para style="p">Topi vala vandu vayisa kumuvakula Yesu na kumuwopa <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yumu wa vala vanachuli va Yesu kakwemula lipanga lyaki, kamudumula ndumindumi wa mtambika mkomi lijeji. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Wuyishi lipanga lyaku muhala, kwanongwa mundu yoyonda yayiminya kwa lipanga dasovi kwa lipanga. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Wuli, mumanya ng'odu kucha ningaweshili kumuluva Tati wangu na mweni tepu hela anganyeghilili mipinga ya Makungu nendu ya lilongu na mivili? <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lakini davavi wuliwuli mayandiku vang'alili yivadeta kucha ndi yidayiliwa kuva?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Chipindi chichilachila Yesu kaliwombela lila lipinga liyisili kumukamula na kumvika pasi yawu. “Wuli, mwisa kungamula kwa mipanga na fimbongu kucha wula nenga ndiva mpoki wa findu fya vandu? Majuva vosi ndaveli Munyumba ya Chapanga pang'ula, mbona mwangamulili ng'odu! <verse number="56" style="v"/>Lakini fyosi afi fikugoleka ili mayandiku va vambuyi va chapanga vagoleki.”</para>
  <para style="p">Pambeli vanachuli vosi vatuva vamuleka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kava pabalasa ya Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:53-65, Lukasi 22:54-55,63-71, Yohani 18:13-14, Yohani 18:19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Topi, vandu vala vamuyegha Yesu kayaki Kayafa, mtambika mkomi, kuvayikunganyili vawula va Malawu na vavaha, <verse number="58" style="v"/>Petili amkovikelili Yesu mbaka paluvagha lwa mtambika mkomi, kayingila mbaka mgati pamu na vadimi ili aweshi kulola findu dafigoleki. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Topi, mtambika mkomi na balasa lyosi vasaka utovileli wa udesi ili vamuwulayi Yesu. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Lakini vapata utovileli wowosi ha, ngimu wuvayisili vatovilela vatangalili va ufyangu. Pambeli vayisa vatovilela vavili, <verse number="61" style="v"/>vadeta, “Mundu ayu adetili: ‘Nguwesha kubowola nyumba ya Chapanga na kuyijenga kandi kwa majuva matatu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Mtambika mkomi kawoloka, kamudasha Yesu, “Wuli mbona ukuyangula chindu ng'odu? Vandu ava vakutovilela liki kwa yuwi?” <verse number="63" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kanyamala jii. Mtambika mkomi kamuwombela, “Wuyilapi kwa litawa lya Chapanga yaveli mnofu, tuwombeli kucha yuwi kuva nakaka Kilistu Mkombola Mwana wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela “Ukudeta yuwi! Lakini nguvawombela, kukandila ponopa damumuwoni Mwana wa Mundu kayikala mwambu wa mlilu wa yula Bambu muna liwovi, payisa mumbindi ya mafundi va kumbindi ya Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Topi, mtambika mkomi kasavanga yingwa yaki kadeta, “Kaduka! Tukudayila kandi utovileli? Ponopa mpikana paduka mweni. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Yumwi mukuwona wuliwuli?” Veni vayangula, “Akudayiliwa asovi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Pambeli vamutemela mita kuwushu na kumuvangula. <verse number="68" style="v"/>Vamonga pavamvanguleyi vadeta, “Yuwi Kilistu Mkombola, tungi ghani kakutova!”</para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 14:66-72, Lukasi 22:56-62, Yohani 18:15-18, Yohani 18:25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Petili aveli kayikala panji kuwuwa, topi, ndumindumi yumu mdadala kamuyendela Petili, kadeta, “Yuwi vaveli pamu na Yesu wa Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Petili kakana pawulongolu ya vosi, kadeta, “Manya ha kucha ukudeta liki.” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Pafumeyi pamulyangu, ndumindumi wingi mdadala kamuwona, kavawombela yivavelili pala, “Mundu ayu aveli pamu na Yesu wa Nasaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Petili kakana kandi kunu payilapa, “Mundu ayu ndimumanya ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Tepu, vandu vamu yivawolukili pala vamuyendela Petili, vamuwombela, “Nakaka yuwi Mgalilaya, kumanyikila detelu yaku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>Topi Petili kakanda kuyilapanga padeta, “Chapanga ang'oni, ndimumanya ng'odu mundu ayu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Tepu njowolu kavika. <verse number="75" style="v"/>Petili kakumbuka filongu fyamuwombilili Yesu, “Njowolu akalihela kuvika, dawunemi myanja mitatu.” Topi, kafuma panji, kalila munu.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyeghiwa kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 15:1, Lukasi 23:1-2, Yohani 18:28-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kukalangali vatambika vakomi na vavaha va vandu yivagolili chitemela kwanongwa ya Yesu ili vamuwulayi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vamuwopa luwoyi, vamutola, vamuyegha kwa Pilatu, mkomi wa Valumi.</para>
  <para style="s">Kusova kwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">Figoli 1:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Topi, Yudasi, ndi yamushengitili, pawonili kucha Yesu kahighiwa kala, kapomela, kavawuyishila vatambika na vavaha yila migwala milongu mitatu ya mbiya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kamuwombela, “Mifya kwa kumutawula Mundu yangajila nongwa awulayiwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini veni vadeta yufwi fya liki afi? “Kamani umweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mweni kasiyasilila mbiya sila munyumba ya Chapanga kafuma panji, kayenda, kayichapika luwoyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi vasitola mbiya sila, vadeta, “Nyanyi ha kusivika nyumba ya Chapanga kwanongwa asi siva mbiya sha mwasi.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi, vawombana, vakahemileli chitava cha muwumbi yivi mahali pa kusikila vandu vatangalili. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ndi nongwa mbaka nalelu chitava chila chikukemiwa “Chitava cha mwasi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi, filongu fya mbuyi wa Chapanga Yelimiya fiva. “Vatolili fipandi milongu mya tatu fya mbiya. Fiyifwanili na yula mundu wa Isilaeli vamuchulusili. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na sila vahemilili wuwowu chitava chamuwumbi kucha bambu palayishili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pilatu akumunasha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 15:2-5, Lukasi 23:3-5, Yohani 18:33-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu awolushiwili pawulongolu ya mkomi wa mkowa. Topi, mkomi wa mkowa kamudasha, “Yuwi kuva Mutwa wa Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamuyangula, “Ukudeta yuwi.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kumbi vatambika vakomi na vavaha pavaveghi vakumuhigha kayangula chindu ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi, Pilatu kamudasha, “Wuli ukupikana duu fyosi afi fivakuhigha yuwi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu kayangula hata chindu chimu ha, hata mkomi wa mkowa ajingili munu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akugayiliwa highilu ya kusova</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 15:6-15, Lukasi 23:13-25, Yohani 18:39-19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yavelili chishovi kila lihungu lya Pasaka mkomi wa mkowa kuvafuwulilila vayawudi mundu yumu yawopiliwili muchijaka. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Chipindi cha pasaka, kwavelili na mundu yumu yawopiliwili muchijaka litawa lyaki Balaba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi, vandu pavayikungili pamu, Pilatu kavadasha, “Mukudayila ndivafuwulili yoti, gati ya ava vavili, Balaba awu Yesu yivamkema Kilistu?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Adetili naha kwanongwa amanyili vamuyeghili Yesu pala kwanongwa ya weyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilatu payikalili pachigoda cha highilu, mwehi mundu amuyeghilili lulayilayi, “Kotoo kwitaya munongwa ya mundu ayu msangi, kwanongwa nalelu gobuleka munu mumilotu kwanongwa ya mweni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini vatambika vakomi na vala vavaha yivavajangajanga vandu kucha afuwuliwi Balaba na Yesu awulayiwi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pilatu kavadasha, “Yoti kwa ava vavili mukudayila ndimulekisheli?”</para>
  <para style="p">Veni vamuyangula, “Balaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilatu kavadasha, “Ponopa, ndimugoli liki Yesu yivamkema Kilistu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vosi vayangula, “Avangiliwi mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pilatu kavadasha kandi, “Kagola chindu liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Veni vayendilela kulandusha lishu, “Avangiliwi mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi, Pilatu pamanyili kucha dalemwi kugola chindu chochosi ila ndilingu shakandili hela, atolili machi, kanava mawoku pawulongolu ya lila lipinga lya vandu. Kadeta, “Nenga mumeli ha munjifwa ya mundu ayu, mani mwaveni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vadeta, “Mwasi waki wutuwoni yufwi pamu na vana vetu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Topi, Pilatu kavagayila Balaba kufuma muchijaka na vavawombela vandu vamulatuli Yesu fiboku na avangiliwi mulupingika.</para>
  <para style="s">Machonda vakumdanila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 15:16-20, Yohani 19:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli machonda va Pilatu vamuyingisha Yesu munyumba ngomi ya mkomi wa mkowa, vayikungula chipuga chosi, vamshengitela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vamuwopusola yingwa shaki, vamufwalisha lihabiti lya langi ngeli. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pambeli vapota likokoma lya misomi vamufwalisha kumutwi, vamuvikila lidengi mukuwoku lyaki lya mlilu. Vatundama pawulongolu yaki, vamudanila pavadeta, “Hasi Mutwa wa Vayawudi!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vamutemela mita, valitola lila lidengi vamutovela nalyu kumutwi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pavamdanilili kala, vamuwopola lila lihabiti, vamufwalisha yingwa shaki, pambeli vamuyegha kumuvangilila mulupingika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvangiliwa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 15:21-32, Lukasi 23:26-43, Yohani 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pavaveghi vakuyenda, vamuwona mundu yumu litawa lyaki Simoni mwenikaya wa Kileni, vamung'ang'anika kuwupapa lupingika lwa Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pavafikili mahali pakukemiwa Goligota, manayaki, mahali pa lipava lya mutwi, <verse number="34" style="v"/>vamupa mhashu wa difwayi na chindu chijejemu. Lakini Yesu payeshili kalema kulanda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vamuvangilila mulupingika, pambeli vavaghana yingwa shaki kwa kugola do. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pambeli vayikala pasi vakumlembilela. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kumbindi ya mutwi waki vavika tangashu ili vandu vamanyi nongwa yivamuhighililili mulupingika, “Ayu ndi Yesu mutwa wa Vayawudi.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Vapoki vavili vavangiliwili mulupingika wuwowu pamu na Yesu, yumu mwambu wa mlilu na wingi mwambu wa mkiyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vandu yivapiteyi pala vamujowulili kunu pava tikanya mitwi yawu kunu pavadeta, <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Yuwi wayijumili ng'odu kuyibowola nyumba ya Chapanga na kuyijenga kwa majuva matatu? Ponopa wuyilowoli umweni! Kucha yuwi kuva Mwana wa Chapanga, topi, wuyiwushi mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ngimu wuwowu vatambika vakomi pamu na vawula va Malawu na vavaha vamudanilili pavadeta, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Wavalowulili vamonga, lakini kulemwa kuyilowola umweni! Kucha mweni mutwa wa Isilaeli! Topi, ponopa asunuki mulupingika na yufwi datumjumili. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Amwidumbili Chapanga na kudeta, kucha mweni mwana wa Chapanga, topi Chapanga amulowoli kucha akumudayila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ngimu wuwowu na vala vavangiliwili pamu na Yesu vamujowulili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akusova mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 15:33-41, Lukasi 23:44-49, Yohani 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kukandila saa sita pamusi mbaka saa tisa chisi chagubikili mlima wosi. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Payifikili saa tisa naha Yesu kalila kwa lishu likomi, “Eli, Eli lama sabakitani?” Mana yaki, “Chapanga wangu, Chapanga wangu, mbona kuneka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lakini vala vawolukili pala pavapikanishili naha vacha, “Akumkema Eliya” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yumu wa vala katuva katola lindelindeli kajabika musiki, kayivika muludengi kamupa afyombi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Vamonga vadeta, “Leki tuloli kucha Eliya dayisi kumulowola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kalila kandi kwa lishu likomi, kasova.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Topi, lupayi lwa mugati lukikisha nyumba ya Chapanga na chumba gati ya nyumba ya Chapanga lidemuka filepa fivili, kufumila kumbindi mbaka pasi, mlima utikanyika, migonguveli yibaluka, <verse number="52" style="v"/>sembi sifuwuka na vandu vang'alili vafwili vashukushiwa. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Na veni pavashukukili kala vafuma musembi, vayingila Yelusalemu mbwani ying'alili, vawoneka na vandu vatangalili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Topi, mkomi wa vala machonda na machonda vaki yivamulembileleyi Yesu pavawonili chiyighayigha cha mlima na fila findu fibwitukili vatila munu, vadeta, “Nakaka Mundu ayu Mwana wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Pala vavelili wuwowu vadadala vatangalili vakulola kwa kutali. Ava ndi vadala vamukovikelili Yesu kufuma Galilaya pavamkimbanikila. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Pagati yawu aveli wuwowu Maliya Magadalena na Maliya mawawu Yakobi na Yosefu pamu na mawawu vana va Sebidayu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akusikwa</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 15:42-47, Lukasi 23:50-56, Yohani 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Payiveyi palumihi, kayisa mundu yumu mlundamali mwenikaya wa Alimataya, litawa lyaki Yosefu, mweni wuwowu aveli mwana chuli wa Yesu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Kamuyendela Pilatu, kaluva agayiliwi chikongu cha Yesu. Topi, Pilatu kalamula agayiliwi. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yosefu katola chila chikongu, kachishengiteshela ligubiku lya nyanyi <verse number="60" style="v"/>kachivika mgati ya sembi yaki ya shonu yisonguliwili muligangachuma, pambeli kalibilibisha ligangachuma likomi paulongolu ya sembi, mweni kawuka. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Maliya Magadalena na yula Maliya wingi vayikalili pasi wushu valola kula kusembi.</para>
  <para style="s">Sembi yikudimiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki ndi lijuva lya mwanja wamumbeli yila ya kuyitalisha, vatambika vakomi na Mafwalisayu, vamuyendilili Pilatu, <verse number="63" style="v"/>vadeta, “Bambu, tukumbuka kucha yula mdesi adetili paghaveyi akali hela kusova, ‘Kucha pavapita majuva matatu dashukuki.’ <verse number="64" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa ayi wuvawombeli vamachonda vadima sembi ya mundu ayu mbaka majuva matatu, ili vanachuli vaki vakotoo kumuhija na kuvawombela vandu kucha kashukuka. Ufyangu wa mwishu dawuvi wa wafu munu pitu wula wa mwanja mtasi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Pilatu kavawombela, “Topi muvanawu vamachonda, muyendi mukalidimi kucha wumuwesha yumwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Topi, vayenda, vayidimi sembi, vamatikila na kushayisha lila ligangachuma na kuvaleka vamachonda vadimi.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kushukuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 16:1-10, Lukasi 24:1-12, Yohani 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Palipelili lijuva lya kupumulila na kukaveli samba kulangala ya lijuva lila lya Jumapili, Maliya Magadalena na yula Maliya wingi vayendili kuyilola yila sembi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tepu liwoneka liyighayigha likomi mumlima Makungu wa Bambu kasunuka kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga kalibilibisha lila ligangachuma, kalikalila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ang'alili kucha lumuli na yingwa shaki shaveli mbuleteee. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vamachonda vala yivadimagha sembi vabagamili, livayingila lyogha likomi, vashulula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini yula Makungu kavawombela vala vadadala, “Yumwi mukotoo kutila! Manya kucha mukumsaka Yesu yavangiliwili mulupingika. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwahela mundu apa nongwa kashukuka kucha wadetili. Mwisi mukaloli pala pavachiwonjishili chikongu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Topi, muyendi kalopu mukavawombeli vanachuli vaki kucha kashukuka kufuma muvasovili na ponopa akuvalongulela kula Galilaya, aku damumuwoni. Muvi na ngumbungumbu na afi finiwawombilili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Topi vala vadadala vawuka kalopu pala pasembi, vatuva vayenda kuvawombela vanachuli vaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tepu, Yesu katang'ana nawu, kadeta, “Hawije!” Vadadala vala vamuyendela, vatundama pawulongolu yaki, vakola mawulu nakumujuma. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela, “Mkotoo kutila! Muyendi mukavawombeli valongu vangu vayendi Galilaya davang'oni aku.”</para>
  <para style="s">Utovileli wa vadimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vala vadadala pavaveghi vakuyenda vadima vamu va sembi yila vayendili kumbwani kuvalandulila vatambika vakomi filongu fyosi fibwitukili. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi, vatangana na vavaha pavawombilili kala, vavapa mbiya sitangalili vala vamachonda <verse number="13" style="v"/>vadeta, “Yumwi mukadeti naha, vanachuli vaki vahija chikongu chaki yufwi tukaveli tuwonja. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na kucha mkomi wa mkowa pamanya chilongu achi, yufwi datuwombani na mweni na yumwi damupati msayisayi ha!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vala vadima vasitola sila mbiya, vagola kucha pavawuliwili. Chilongu achi chikwila kwa Vayawudi mbaka nalelu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvafumbukila vanachuli vaki</para>
  <para style="r">Maliku 16:14-18, Lukasi 24:36-49, Yohani 20:19-23, Figoli 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vala vanachuli lilongu na yumu vayendili Galilaya kuchidunda chila chavalaghili Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pavamuwonili vajuma, hata leki vamonga vavelili na hoshu, <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kaselela pabehi, kavawombela, “Gayiliwa ukomi wosi wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na mumlima awu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Topi, muyendi, mukavagoli vandu va milima na makabila vosi vavi vanachuli vangu, pamuvabatisha kwa litawa lya Tati na lya Mwana na lya Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Muvawuli kukamula Malawu vosi yindivagayilili. Na nenga ndiva pamu na yuwi majuva vosi, mbaka mwishu wa mlima.”</para>
</usx>
